#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:4
msgid "Isaac Capture"
msgstr "Isaac Capture"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:8
msgid ""
"`Isaac Capture <https://github.com/NVIDIA/IsaacCapture>`_ is the unified "
"framework for high-fidelity egocentric and robot data collection. It "
"provides a standardized device interface, a flexible graph-based retargeting"
" pipeline, and works seamlessly across simulated and real-world robots."
msgstr ""
"`Isaac Capture <https://github.com/NVIDIA/IsaacCapture>`_ "
"是用于高保真第一视角数据和机器人数据采集的统一框架。它提供标准化设备接口及灵活的计算图式重定向流水线，可用于仿真和真实机器人。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:14
msgid ""
"**Name transition.** Isaac Teleop was rebranded as **Isaac Capture**. Isaac "
"Lab currently pins the 1.4 release, whose Python distribution and import "
"package are still named ``isaacteleop``. Upstream renamed both to "
"``isaaccapture`` in 1.6, so the ``isaacteleop`` commands and imports in this"
" documentation are intentional. See the `Isaac Capture migration guide "
"<https://nvidia.github.io/IsaacCapture/main/references/migration.html>`_ for"
" details."
msgstr ""
"**名称变更。** Isaac Teleop 已更名为 **Isaac Capture** 。Isaac Lab 当前固定使用 1.4 版本，该版本的 "
"Python 发行包和导入包仍名为 ``isaacteleop`` 。上游在 1.6 中将两者改名为 ``isaaccapture`` ，因此本文档中的"
" ``isaacteleop`` 命令和导入名是有意保留的。详见 `Isaac Capture 迁移指南 "
"<https://nvidia.github.io/IsaacCapture/main/references/migration.html>`_ 。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:20
msgid ""
"Isaac Capture replaces the previous native XR teleop stack "
"(``isaaclab.devices.openxr``) in Isaac Lab. For migration details see "
":ref:`migrating-to-isaaclab-3-0`."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Capture 替代了 Isaac Lab 原有的原生 XR 遥操作组件（ ``isaaclab.devices.openxr`` "
"）。迁移说明见 :ref:`migrating-to-isaaclab-3-0` 。"

