#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:107
msgid ""
"**Why motion controllers for manipulation?** Controllers provide precise "
"spatial control via a grip pose and a physical trigger for gripper "
"actuation, making them ideal for pick-and-place tasks."
msgstr "**为什么操作任务推荐运动控制器？** 控制器通过握持位姿提供精确的空间控制，并用实体扳机控制夹爪，非常适合抓取放置任务。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:110
msgid ""
"**Why hand tracking for complex dex hands?** Hand tracking captures the full"
" 26-joint hand pose required for high-fidelity dexterous retargeting. This "
"is essential when individual finger control matters."
msgstr ""
"**为什么复杂灵巧手推荐手部跟踪？** 手部跟踪能采集完整的 26 关节手部位姿，满足高保真灵巧重定向的要求。需要单独控制手指时，这一点尤为关键。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:118
msgid "How It Works"
msgstr "工作原理"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:120
msgid ""
"The :class:`~isaaclab_teleop.IsaacTeleopDevice` is the main integration "
"point between Isaac Capture and Isaac Lab. It composes three collaborators:"
msgstr ""
":class:`~isaaclab_teleop.IsaacTeleopDevice` 是 Isaac Capture 与 Isaac Lab "
"的主要集成入口，由三个协作组件组成："

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:123
msgid ""
"**XrAnchorManager** -- creates and synchronizes an XR anchor prim in the "
"simulation, and computes the ``world_T_anchor`` transform matrix that maps "
"XR tracking data into the simulation coordinate frame."
msgstr ""
"**XrAnchorManager** ：在仿真中创建并同步 XR 锚点 prim，计算 ``world_T_anchor`` 变换矩阵，将 XR "
"跟踪数据映射到仿真坐标系。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:127
msgid ""
"**TeleopSessionLifecycle** -- builds the retargeting pipeline, acquires "
"OpenXR handles from Isaac Sim's XR bridge (or, in standalone mode, creates "
"its own OpenXR session through the CloudXR runtime -- see :ref:`isaac-"
"teleop-standalone`), creates the ``TeleopSession``, and steps it each frame "
"to produce an action tensor."
msgstr ""
"**TeleopSessionLifecycle** ：构建重定向流水线，从 Isaac Sim 的 XR 桥接层获取 OpenXR "
"句柄（独立模式下则通过 CloudXR 运行时自行创建 OpenXR 会话，见 :ref:`isaac-teleop-standalone` ），创建 "
"``TeleopSession`` ，并逐帧推进会话以生成动作张量。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:132
msgid ""
"**CommandHandler** -- lightweight callback registry for START / STOP / RESET"
" commands.  Scripts can register callbacks via "
":meth:`~isaaclab_teleop.IsaacTeleopDevice.add_callback`, but the primary "
"control path uses :func:`~isaaclab_teleop.poll_control_events` (see "
":ref:`isaac-teleop-control-states`)."
msgstr ""
"**CommandHandler** ：轻量级 START / STOP / RESET 命令回调注册表。脚本可通过 "
":meth:`~isaaclab_teleop.IsaacTeleopDevice.add_callback` 注册回调，但主要控制流程使用 "
":func:`~isaaclab_teleop.poll_control_events` （见 :ref:`isaac-teleop-control-"
"states` ）。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:0
msgid "Session lifecycle details"
msgstr "会话生命周期详情"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:139
msgid ""
"The session uses **deferred creation**: if the user has not yet clicked "
"\"Start XR\" in the Isaac Sim UI, the session is not created immediately. "
"Instead, each call to ``advance()`` retries session creation until OpenXR "
"handles become available. Once connected, ``advance()`` returns a flattened "
"action tensor (``torch.Tensor``) on the configured device. It returns "
"``None`` when the session is not yet ready or has been torn down."
msgstr ""
"会话采用 **延迟创建** ：如果用户尚未在 Isaac Sim 界面中点击“Start XR”，就不会立即创建会话。每次调用 "
"``advance()`` 时都会重试，直到 OpenXR 句柄可用。连接成功后， ``advance()`` 返回位于所配置设备上的展平动作张量（ "
"``torch.Tensor`` ）。会话尚未就绪或已销毁时，返回 ``None`` 。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:145
msgid ""
"In standalone mode (:ref:`isaac-teleop-standalone`), creation is **not** "
"gated on Kit XR handles -- the session starts as soon as the CloudXR runtime"
" is available."
msgstr ""
"在独立模式（ :ref:`isaac-teleop-standalone` ）下，创建会话 **不需要** 等待 Kit XR 句柄，CloudXR "
"运行时可用时即可启动。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:152
msgid "Visualize XR Tracking"
msgstr "显示 XR 跟踪数据"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:154
msgid ""
"Isaac Capture can draw the raw XR tracking poses in the Isaac Lab world "
"frame. Use this visualization to confirm that tracking data is available and"
" aligned with the simulated robot:"
msgstr ""
"Isaac Capture 可在 Isaac Lab 世界坐标系中绘制原始 XR 跟踪位姿。通过可视化可确认跟踪数据是否可用、是否与仿真机器人对齐："

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:157
msgid ""
"red spheres show the 26 joints of each tracked hand when the retargeting "
"pipeline contains a ``HandsSource``;"
msgstr "重定向流水线包含 ``HandsSource`` 时，红色球体显示每只被跟踪手的 26 个关节；"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:159
msgid ""
"RGB coordinate axes show the OpenXR aim pose of each tracked controller. The"
" X, Y, and Z axes are red, green, and blue, respectively, and the "
"controller's ``-Z`` axis points forward in its natural pointing direction."
msgstr ""
"RGB 坐标轴显示每个被跟踪控制器的 OpenXR 指向位姿。X、Y、Z 轴分别为红、绿、蓝；控制器的 ``-Z`` 轴沿其自然指向方向朝前。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:163
msgid "Enable the visualization when launching a teleoperation session:"
msgstr "启动遥操作会话时启用可视化："

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:0
msgid "uv (Recommended)"
msgstr "uv（推荐）"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:0
msgid "isaaclab.sh / isaaclab.bat"
msgstr "isaaclab.sh / isaaclab.bat"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:187
msgid ""
"The ``--enable_debug_visualization`` flag is also available in "
"``scripts/tools/record_demos.py`` and "
"``scripts/environments/teleoperation/teleop_replay_agent.py``. The option is"
" applied when the Isaac Capture device is created and cannot be toggled "
"during a running device session. The markers are diagnostic only and do not "
"change the actions produced by the retargeting pipeline."
msgstr ""
"``scripts/tools/record_demos.py`` 和 "
"``scripts/environments/teleoperation/teleop_replay_agent.py`` 也提供 "
"``--enable_debug_visualization`` 标志。此选项在创建 Isaac Capture "
"设备时应用，设备会话运行期间无法切换。标记仅用于诊断，不会改变重定向流水线生成的动作。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:194
msgid ""
"Tracking markers are only visible when the Kit visualizer is active. A "
"marker is created after the corresponding hand or controller first produces "
"valid tracking data."
msgstr "只有启用 Kit 可视化器时才能看到跟踪标记。对应的手或控制器首次提供有效跟踪数据后，才会创建标记。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:201
msgid "Teleop Control States (Start / Stop / Reset)"
msgstr "遥操作控制状态（Start / Stop / Reset）"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:203
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab supports remote teleop control commands -- **start**, **stop**, "
"and **reset** -- sent from the XR headset to the simulation.  These are used"
" to begin and end demonstration recording, pause the robot, or reset the "
"environment without touching the simulation host. The same commands can be "
"driven **locally** without a headset via "
":meth:`~isaaclab_teleop.IsaacTeleopDevice.request_start` / "
":meth:`~isaaclab_teleop.IsaacTeleopDevice.request_stop` and "
":meth:`~isaaclab_teleop.IsaacTeleopDevice.reset` (see :ref:`isaac-teleop-"
"standalone`)."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 支持从 XR 头显向仿真发送 **start** 、 **stop** 和 **reset** "
"远程遥操作控制命令。它们用于开始或结束示范录制、暂停机器人或重置环境，无需接触仿真主机。没有头显时，也可通过 "
":meth:`~isaaclab_teleop.IsaacTeleopDevice.request_start` / "
":meth:`~isaaclab_teleop.IsaacTeleopDevice.request_stop` 及 "
":meth:`~isaaclab_teleop.IsaacTeleopDevice.reset` 在 **本地** 触发相同命令（见 "
":ref:`isaac-teleop-standalone` ）。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:212
msgid "How it works"
msgstr "它是如何工作的"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:214
msgid ""
"By default, every :class:`~isaaclab_teleop.IsaacTeleopCfg` enables a control"
" message channel using the well-known UUID ``uuid5(NAMESPACE_DNS, "
"\"teleop_command\")``.  The channel is created as a "
"``teleop_control_pipeline`` inside TeleopCore's :class:`TeleopSession`, "
"which means:"
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，每个 :class:`~isaaclab_teleop.IsaacTeleopCfg` 都使用约定的 UUID "
"``uuid5(NAMESPACE_DNS, \"teleop_command\")`` 启用控制消息通道。该通道作为 "
"``teleop_control_pipeline`` 创建于 TeleopCore 的 :class:`TeleopSession` "
"内，具体流程如下："

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:218
msgid ""
"A "
":class:`~isaacteleop.retargeting_engine.deviceio_source_nodes.MessageChannelSource`"
" opens an OpenXR opaque data channel (``XR_NV_opaque_data_channel``) with "
"the agreed-upon UUID."
msgstr ""
":class:`~isaacteleop.retargeting_engine.deviceio_source_nodes.MessageChannelSource`"
" 使用约定 UUID，打开一个 OpenXR 不透明数据通道（ ``XR_NV_opaque_data_channel`` ）。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:220
msgid ""
"The CloudXR JS client (or any other client) discovers the channel by UUID "
"and sends UTF-8 JSON commands::"
msgstr "CloudXR JS 客户端（或其他客户端）通过 UUID 发现通道，并发送 UTF-8 编码的 JSON 命令::"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:227
msgid ""
"A :class:`~isaaclab_teleop.teleop_message_processor.TeleopMessageProcessor` "
"parses these payloads and produces boolean pulse signals (``run_toggle``, "
"``kill``, ``reset``)."
msgstr ""
":class:`~isaaclab_teleop.teleop_message_processor.TeleopMessageProcessor` "
"解析这些消息，生成布尔脉冲信号（ ``run_toggle`` 、 ``kill`` 、 ``reset`` ）。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:229
msgid ""
":class:`~isaacteleop.teleop_session_manager.DefaultTeleopStateManager` "
"consumes the boolean signals, runs its state machine (edge detection, fail-"
"safe), and produces ``teleop_state`` (one-hot) and ``reset_event`` (bool "
"pulse) outputs."
msgstr ""
":class:`~isaacteleop.teleop_session_manager.DefaultTeleopStateManager` "
"接收布尔信号，运行其状态机（边沿检测、故障保护），并输出 ``teleop_state`` （独热编码）及 ``reset_event`` "
"（布尔脉冲）。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:232
msgid ""
"TeleopCore decodes these outputs into ``ExecutionEvents`` and injects them "
"into every retargeter's ``ComputeContext``, so stateful retargeters can "
"react to state changes (e.g. reinitializing cross-step state on reset)."
msgstr ""
"TeleopCore 将这些输出解码为 ``ExecutionEvents`` ，注入每个重定向器的 ``ComputeContext`` "
"，使有状态的重定向器能够响应状态变化，例如重置时重新初始化跨步状态。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:237
msgid "Polling control events in your script"
msgstr "在脚本中轮询控制事件"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:239
msgid ""
"Use :func:`~isaaclab_teleop.poll_control_events` to read the latest control "
"state each frame:"
msgstr "使用 :func:`~isaaclab_teleop.poll_control_events` 逐帧读取最新控制状态："

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:261
msgid ":class:`~isaaclab_teleop.ControlEvents` has two fields:"
msgstr ":class:`~isaaclab_teleop.ControlEvents` 有两个字段："

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:263
msgid ""
"``is_active`` -- ``True`` after a \"start\" command, ``False`` after "
"\"stop\", ``None`` when no command has been received yet (callers should "
"leave their own flag unchanged)."
msgstr ""
"``is_active`` ：收到“start”命令后为 ``True`` ，收到“stop”后为 ``False`` ；尚未收到任何命令时为 "
"``None`` ，此时调用方应保留自己的标志值。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:265
msgid ""
"``should_reset`` -- ``True`` for exactly one frame after a \"reset\" "
"command."
msgstr "``should_reset`` ：收到“reset”命令后，仅一帧为 ``True`` 。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:268
msgid "Disabling the control channel"
msgstr "关闭控制通道"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:270
msgid ""
"If you do not need headset-driven start/stop/reset (e.g. keyboard-only "
"workflows), set ``control_channel_uuid=None`` in your config:"
msgstr "如果不需要由头显触发开始、停止及重置（如仅使用键盘的工作流），在配置中设置 ``control_channel_uuid=None`` ："

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:281
msgid "Using a custom channel UUID"
msgstr "使用自定义通道 UUID"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:283
msgid ""
"To use a different channel UUID (e.g. for a separate control protocol), pass"
" any 16-byte ``bytes`` value:"
msgstr "要使用其他通道 UUID（如用于独立控制协议），传入任意 16 字节的 ``bytes`` 值："

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:297
msgid ""
"The CloudXR JS client must be updated to discover this UUID when sending "
"commands."
msgstr "必须同步更新 CloudXR JS 客户端，使它发送命令时能发现该 UUID。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:303
msgid "Run Without a Headset (Standalone I/O)"
msgstr "不使用头显运行（独立 I/O）"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:305
msgid ""
"By default the teleop scripts drive Isaac Capture through Isaac Sim's Kit XR"
" bridge, which renders the scene to a connected XR headset. When you only "
"need Isaac Capture as an **input/output transport** -- for example a joint-"
"space leader arm streaming encoder angles, or any non-XR device -- you can "
"run it *standalone*, with no Kit XR rendering."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，遥操作脚本通过 Isaac Sim 的 Kit XR 桥接层驱动 Isaac Capture，将场景渲染到已连接的 XR 头显。如果只需要将"
" Isaac Capture 用作 **输入/输出传输通道** ，例如主控机械臂传输关节编码器角度，或使用其他非 XR 设备，则可采用 *独立* "
"模式，无需 Kit XR 渲染。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:310
msgid ""
"The ``teleop_se3_agent.py`` and ``record_demos.py`` scripts select the mode "
"with the ``--xr`` flag:"
msgstr "``teleop_se3_agent.py`` 和 ``record_demos.py`` 通过 ``--xr`` 标志选择模式："

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:312
msgid ""
"**With** ``--xr`` -- the full Kit XR path (headset rendering, anchor, hand /"
" controller tracking)."
msgstr "**传入** ``--xr`` ：完整 Kit XR 流程，包括头显渲染、锚点及手部/控制器跟踪。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:313
msgid ""
"**Without** ``--xr`` -- Isaac Capture creates and owns its own OpenXR "
"session through the CloudXR runtime (``create_isaac_teleop_device(..., "
"use_kit_xr_bridge=False)``); teleop input/output works headless, with no Kit"
" XR rendering."
msgstr ""
"**不传入** ``--xr`` ：Isaac Capture 通过 CloudXR 运行时创建并管理自己的 OpenXR 会话（ "
"``create_isaac_teleop_device(..., use_kit_xr_bridge=False)`` "
"）；遥操作输入/输出可无界面运行，无需 Kit XR 渲染。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:318
msgid "Starting teleop without a headset"
msgstr "不使用头显启动遥操作"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:320
msgid ""
"Without a headset there is no client to send the **start** command, so the "
"scripts drive the state machine locally:"
msgstr "没有头显时，也没有客户端发送 **start** 命令，因此脚本在本地驱动状态机："

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:323
msgid ""
"On startup they call "
":meth:`~isaaclab_teleop.IsaacTeleopDevice.request_start`, which transitions "
"the teleop state machine to RUNNING (see :ref:`isaac-teleop-control-states`)"
" -- so a headless session begins running immediately, with no headset UI."
msgstr ""
"启动时调用 :meth:`~isaaclab_teleop.IsaacTeleopDevice.request_start` ，将遥操作状态机切换为 "
"RUNNING（见 :ref:`isaac-teleop-control-states` ），使无界面会话立即开始运行，无需头显界面。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:326
msgid ""
"When a Kit viewport window is present, they also bind keys for interactive "
"control:"
msgstr "存在 Kit 视口窗口时，还会绑定交互控制按键："

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:332 source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:598
msgid "Key"
msgstr "按键"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:333 source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:599
msgid "Action"
msgstr "操作"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:334 source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:600
msgid "``B``"
msgstr "``B``"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:335 source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:601
msgid "Start / resume teleoperation."
msgstr "开始或恢复遥操作。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:336 source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:602
msgid "``P``"
msgstr "``P``"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:337
msgid "Pause teleoperation (robot holds position)."
msgstr "暂停遥操作（机器人保持当前位置）。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:338 source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:604
msgid "``R``"
msgstr "``R``"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:339 source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:605
msgid "Reset the environment."
msgstr "重置环境。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:341
msgid ""
"Both paths flow through the same state machine, so "
":meth:`~isaaclab_teleop.IsaacTeleopDevice.request_start` / "
":meth:`~isaaclab_teleop.IsaacTeleopDevice.request_stop` and remote headset "
"commands are interchangeable, and "
":func:`~isaaclab_teleop.poll_control_events` stays authoritative."
msgstr ""
"两种方式使用同一状态机，因此 :meth:`~isaaclab_teleop.IsaacTeleopDevice.request_start` / "
":meth:`~isaaclab_teleop.IsaacTeleopDevice.request_stop` 与头显远程命令可以互换使用， "
":func:`~isaaclab_teleop.poll_control_events` 始终提供权威状态。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:348
msgid ""
"A clientless CloudXR runtime advertises no HMD, so the standalone OpenXR "
"session needs a device profile that reports a system without a connected "
"client. The scripts default ``--cloudxr_env`` to "
":data:`~isaaclab_teleop.CLOUDXR_STANDALONE_ENV` when ``--xr`` is omitted "
"(and to ``cloudxrjs`` when it is passed); see :ref:`isaac-teleop-cloudxr-"
"profiles`."
msgstr ""
"没有客户端连接的 CloudXR 运行时不会报告头显，因此独立 OpenXR 会话需要一种在未连接客户端时也会报告系统的设备配置。省略 ``--xr``"
" 时，脚本默认将 ``--cloudxr_env`` 设为 "
":data:`~isaaclab_teleop.CLOUDXR_STANDALONE_ENV` ；传入该标志时则默认为 ``cloudxrjs`` 。见"
" :ref:`isaac-teleop-cloudxr-profiles` 。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:356
msgid "Example: SO-101 leader-arm joint teleoperation"
msgstr "示例：SO-101 主控臂关节遥操作"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:358
msgid ""
"``IsaacContrib-Stack-Cube-SO101-Joint-Teleop-v0`` mirrors the joint angles "
"streamed by a physical SO-101 leader arm directly onto the simulated "
"follower -- no XR headset, inverse kinematics, or anchor. Its pipeline is "
"``JointStateSource -> JointStateRetargeter (mode=\"joint\") -> "
"TensorReorderer``."
msgstr ""
"``IsaacContrib-Stack-Cube-SO101-Joint-Teleop-v0`` 将真实 SO-101 "
"主控臂传输的关节角直接映射到仿真从动臂，无需 XR 头显、逆向运动学或锚点。流水线为 ``JointStateSource -> "
"JointStateRetargeter (mode=\"joint\") -> TensorReorderer`` 。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:363
msgid ""
"For the end-to-end walkthrough -- building the plugin, hardware setup, "
"calibration, launching, and recording a dataset -- see `Data Collection in "
"Sim`_ in the Isaac Capture documentation. The prerequisites below are the "
"minimum needed to get this example running."
msgstr ""
"完整流程，包括插件构建、硬件配置、校准、启动及数据集录制，见 Isaac Capture 文档中的 `仿真中的数据采集 <Data Collection"
" in Sim_>`_ 。以下前提条件是运行本示例的最低要求。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:368
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "先决条件"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:370
msgid ""
"**SO-101 hardware**: A physical SO-101 leader arm connected to the "
"workstation over USB."
msgstr "**SO-101 硬件** ：通过 USB 连接到工作站的真实 SO-101 主控臂。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:372
msgid ""
"**The** ``so101_leader`` **plugin, built from Isaac Capture source**: the "
"leader's joint state is streamed by a standalone C++ plugin that you run "
"alongside the sim."
msgstr ""
"**从 Isaac Capture 源代码构建的** ``so101_leader`` **插件** ：主控臂关节状态由独立的 C++ "
"插件传输，需要与仿真同时运行。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:377
msgid ""
"``so101_leader_plugin`` is **not** shipped with Isaac Lab, is **not** part "
"of the ``isaacteleop`` pip package, and is not in any release archive. It "
"exists only after building the `Isaac Capture "
"<https://github.com/NVIDIA/IsaacCapture>`_ repository from source. If "
"``install/plugins/so101_leader/so101_leader_plugin`` does not exist in your "
"Isaac Capture checkout, this step has not been completed."
msgstr ""
"``so101_leader_plugin`` **不随** Isaac Lab 提供， **不属于** ``isaacteleop`` pip "
"包，也不在任何发布压缩包中。只有从源代码构建 `Isaac Capture "
"<https://github.com/NVIDIA/IsaacCapture>`_ 仓库后才会生成。如果 Isaac Capture 仓库中不存在 "
"``install/plugins/so101_leader/so101_leader_plugin`` ，说明尚未完成此步骤。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:383
msgid ""
"Install the build prerequisites first -- a missing ``clang-format-14`` is "
"the most common cause of a failed build, because the format check is "
"enforced by default on Linux:"
msgstr "先安装构建依赖。Linux 默认强制执行格式检查，因此缺少 ``clang-format-14`` 是构建失败最常见的原因："

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:391
msgid ""
"Then clone, check out the release branch matching the ``isaacteleop`` "
"version Isaac Lab is pinned to (``isaacteleop~=1.4.145`` in the ``teleop`` "
"extra of the root ``pyproject.toml``, so the plugin's wire format matches "
"the ``isaacteleop`` package Isaac Lab installs), configure, build, and "
"install. To target a specific Python version, pass "
"``-DISAAC_TELEOP_PYTHON_VERSION=3.12`` (or ``3.11``, ``3.13``) on the "
"configure line; each version needs its own build directory if building "
"multiple at once:"
msgstr ""
"然后克隆仓库，切换到与 Isaac Lab 固定的 ``isaacteleop`` 版本匹配的发布分支，再配置、构建并安装。根目录 "
"``pyproject.toml`` 的 ``teleop`` 额外依赖指定 ``isaacteleop~=1.4.145`` "
"；分支匹配可确保插件的通信格式与 Isaac Lab 安装的 ``isaacteleop`` 包一致。要指定 Python 版本，在配置命令中传入 "
"``-DISAAC_TELEOP_PYTHON_VERSION=3.12`` （或 ``3.11`` 、 ``3.13`` "
"）；同时构建多个版本时，每个版本需要单独的构建目录："

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:410
msgid ""
"When Isaac Lab updates its teleoperation dependency, check out the matching "
"``release/<version>.x`` branch instead."
msgstr "Isaac Lab 更新遥操作依赖时，应改为检出匹配的 ``release/<version>.x`` 分支。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:413
msgid ""
"The plugin is installed to "
"``<IsaacCapture>/install/plugins/so101_leader/so101_leader_plugin``. Every "
"later command in this section runs from the Isaac Capture checkout root; "
"substitute your own path for ``/path/to/IsaacCapture``. Verify the build by "
"running the plugin with **no arguments** -- that selects the synthetic "
"backend, so it starts without any hardware attached:"
msgstr ""
"插件安装到 ``<IsaacCapture>/install/plugins/so101_leader/so101_leader_plugin`` "
"。本节后续所有命令都在 Isaac Capture 仓库根目录运行，请将 ``/path/to/IsaacCapture`` 替换为实际路径。先 "
"**不传任何参数** 运行插件，以验证构建；此时会使用合成后端，无需连接硬件即可启动："

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:423
msgid ""
"See `Build from Source`_ for the full prerequisite list and all build "
"options, and the build-troubleshooting table in `Data Collection in Sim`_ "
"for common failures (including the ``clang-format not found but "
"ENABLE_CLANG_FORMAT_CHECK is ON`` CMake error)."
msgstr ""
"完整依赖列表及全部构建选项，见 `从源代码构建 <Build from Source_>`_ ；常见失败原因见 `仿真中的数据采集 <Data "
"Collection in Sim_>`_ 的构建故障排查表，包括 CMake 错误 ``clang-format not found but "
"ENABLE_CLANG_FORMAT_CHECK is ON`` 。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:427
msgid ""
"**Calibration**: The SO-101 arm must be calibrated before use. The plugin "
"talks to the FEETECH servos directly -- it has no ``lerobot`` or FEETECH SDK"
" dependency -- so calibrate with its own ``calibrate`` subcommand, which "
"needs no OpenXR runtime."
msgstr ""
"**校准** ：SO-101 机械臂使用前必须校准。插件直接与 FEETECH 舵机通信，不依赖 ``lerobot`` 或 FEETECH "
"SDK，因此应使用它自身的 ``calibrate`` 子命令，无需 OpenXR 运行时。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:431
msgid ""
"First, identify the serial port. The easiest way is ``uvx``, which runs "
"``lerobot-find-port`` in a temporary environment with no installation "
"required:"
msgstr "先确定串口。最简单的方法是使用 ``uvx`` ，它会在临时环境中运行 ``lerobot-find-port`` ，无需安装："

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:438
msgid "Alternatively, plug in the USB cable and immediately run:"
msgstr "也可以插入 USB 线后立即运行："

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:444
msgid ""
"Because ``tail -1`` shows only the most recent kernel message, the output "
"unambiguously names the just-connected device, e.g. ``[12345.6] usb ... "
"ttyACM0``. Use that path (``/dev/ttyACM0``, ``/dev/ttyACM1``, etc.) in the "
"commands below."
msgstr ""
"``tail -1`` 只显示最新一条内核消息，因此输出会明确指出刚连接的设备，例如 ``[12345.6] usb ... "
"ttyACM0``。请在下面的命令中使用对应路径，例如 ``/dev/ttyACM0``、``/dev/ttyACM1`` 等。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:448
msgid ""
"On Linux, serial devices are owned by the ``dialout`` group, so the plugin "
"fails with ``Permission denied`` unless your user can access the port. Add "
"your user to the group once, then log out and back in for it to take effect:"
msgstr ""
"Linux 中的串口设备属于 ``dialout`` 用户组。如果当前用户无权访问端口，插件会报 ``Permission "
"denied``。将用户加入该组一次，然后注销并重新登录，使其生效："

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:456
msgid ""
"Alternatively, grant access for the current session only (this resets when "
"the arm is unplugged):"
msgstr "也可以只为当前会话授予访问权限，拔下机械臂后权限会恢复："

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:462
msgid "Then run the calibration:"
msgstr "然后运行标定："

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:469
msgid ""
"It runs two interactive steps (hold the arm at mid-range, then sweep every "
"joint through its full range) and writes the calibration file, which the "
"plugin reads at startup to map raw encoder values to joint angles. An "
"existing LeRobot calibration ``.json`` can be passed instead. Running "
"without calibration produces incorrect joint mappings and the follower arm "
"will not track the leader."
msgstr ""
"校准包含两个交互步骤：先将机械臂保持在行程中间，再让每个关节走遍完整行程。随后写出校准文件，插件启动时读取它，将原始编码器值映射为关节角。也可传入现有的"
" LeRobot 校准 ``.json`` 。未经校准运行会使关节映射错误，从动臂无法跟踪主控臂。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:475
msgid "SO-101 leader arm held in the mid-range calibration pose"
msgstr "SO-101 主控臂保持在行程中间的校准姿态"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:479
msgid ""
"SO-101 leader arm in the mid-range pose used for the first calibration step."
msgstr "SO-101 主控臂处于第一步校准使用的行程中间姿态。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:483
msgid ""
"In the mid-range step, also set the gripper to the midpoint of its travel, "
"as pictured. Leaving it fully open or closed can produce an incorrect "
"gripper mapping."
msgstr "在行程中间校准这一步，也应如图所示将夹爪置于行程中点。完全打开或闭合可能导致夹爪映射错误。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:487
msgid "Run the simulation"
msgstr "运行仿真"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:489
msgid ""
"The SO-101 workflow supports two monitoring modes -- choose based on whether"
" you have an XR headset available:"
msgstr "SO-101 工作流支持两种观察方式，根据是否有 XR 头显选择："

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:492
msgid "**Without a headset (local viewport only)**"
msgstr "**无头显（仅本地视口）**"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:494
msgid ""
"Omit ``--xr``. The sim runs in standalone mode and the teleop state machine "
"starts automatically on launch -- no headset connection is needed (see "
":ref:`isaac-teleop-standalone`). Pass ``--visualizer kit`` to watch the "
"follower in the local Kit viewport; headless is the default."
msgstr ""
"省略 ``--xr`` 。仿真以独立模式运行，启动时自动开启遥操作状态机，无需连接头显（见 :ref:`isaac-teleop-standalone`"
" ）。传入 ``--visualizer kit`` 可在本地 Kit 视口中观察从动臂；默认为无界面模式。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:520
msgid "**With a headset (immersive XR view)**"
msgstr "**有头显（沉浸式 XR 视图）**"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:522
msgid ""
"Add ``--xr`` to stream the simulation to a Quest, Pico, or Apple Vision Pro "
"headset while the SO-101 leader arm still drives the follower joints. The "
"retargeting pipeline is unchanged; ``--xr`` only controls whether the scene "
"is rendered to the headset. Follow the connection steps in :ref:`connect-xr-"
"device` to pair the headset after launching."
msgstr ""
"添加 ``--xr`` 可将仿真串流到 Quest、Pico 或 Apple Vision Pro 头显，同时仍由 SO-101 "
"主控臂驱动从动臂关节。重定向流水线不变， ``--xr`` 只决定是否将场景渲染到头显。启动后，按 :ref:`connect-xr-device` "
"的步骤连接头显。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:550
msgid "Start the plugin"
msgstr "启动插件"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:552
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab does not spawn the plugin for you. Launch the sim first -- it "
"brings up the CloudXR runtime the plugin connects through -- then, in a "
"**separate terminal**, source the environment file the runtime writes on "
"startup (this points the OpenXR loader at CloudXR) and start the plugin on "
"the leader's serial port (replace ``/dev/ttyACM0`` with your device -- see "
"the port-identification note in the Calibration step above):"
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 不会代您启动插件。请先启动仿真，它会启动插件连接所需的 CloudXR 运行时。然后在 **另一个终端** "
"中，加载运行时启动时写出的环境文件（将 OpenXR 加载器指向 CloudXR），再使用主控臂串口启动插件。请将 ``/dev/ttyACM0`` "
"替换为实际设备，串口识别方法见上文校准步骤："

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:564
msgid ""
"Arguments are positional: ``[device_path] [collection_id] "
"[calibration_file]``. The ``collection_id`` must stay ``so101_leader`` -- "
"that is the tensor collection this task's ``JointStateSource`` subscribes "
"to."
msgstr ""
"参数按位置传入： ``[device_path] [collection_id] [calibration_file]`` 。 "
"``collection_id`` 必须保持为 ``so101_leader`` ，它是该任务的 ``JointStateSource`` "
"订阅的张量集合。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:568
msgid ""
"Running the plugin with **no arguments at all** streams a synthetic "
"trajectory on the default ``so101_leader`` collection, which is a good way "
"to confirm the sim side is wired up before connecting hardware. Because the "
"arguments are positional, there is no way to skip only the device path while"
" still passing the later two:"
msgstr ""
"**完全不传参数** 运行插件时，会向默认的 ``so101_leader`` "
"集合传输合成轨迹，适合在连接硬件前确认仿真侧连接正确。由于参数是位置参数，无法只跳过设备路径、却仍传入后两个参数："

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:577
msgid ""
"See the `SO-101 plugin README`_ and `Data Collection in Sim`_ for all "
"configuration options."
msgstr ""
"全部配置选项见 `SO-101 插件 README <SO-101 plugin README_>`_ 和 `仿真中的数据采集 <Data "
"Collection in Sim_>`_ 。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:580
msgid "Start teleoperation"
msgstr "启动遥操作"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:582
msgid ""
"**Without ``--xr``**: the script calls "
":meth:`~isaaclab_teleop.IsaacTeleopDevice.request_start` automatically on "
"startup, so the follower begins mirroring the leader immediately with no "
"additional input required."
msgstr ""
"**不使用** ``--xr`` ：脚本启动时自动调用 "
":meth:`~isaaclab_teleop.IsaacTeleopDevice.request_start` "
"，从动臂立即开始跟随主控臂，无需其他输入。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:586
msgid ""
"**With ``--xr``**: a **start** command can be sent from the connected "
"headset UI (Quest / Pico: the CloudXR.js **Connect** button; Apple Vision "
"Pro: the **Play** button in the Isaac XR Teleop Sample Client). The SO-101 "
"then begins driving the follower as soon as the headset sends the start "
"command."
msgstr ""
"**使用** ``--xr`` ：可从已连接头显的界面发送 **start** 命令。Quest / Pico 使用 CloudXR.js 的 "
"**Connect** 按钮，Apple Vision Pro 使用 Isaac XR Teleop Sample Client 的 **Play** "
"按钮。头显发送启动命令后，SO-101 开始驱动从动臂。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:591
msgid ""
"Regardless of mode, when the Kit viewport is open you can also control the "
"session with keyboard shortcuts:"
msgstr "无论采用哪种模式，打开 Kit 视口时也可用键盘快捷键控制会话："

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:603
msgid "Pause teleoperation (follower holds position)."
msgstr "暂停遥操作（从动臂保持当前位置）。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:609
msgid ""
"Pressing ``R`` both resets the environment **and pauses teleoperation** -- "
"it does not resume automatically. This is intentional: this task's joint-"
"teleop pipeline mirrors the leader arm's raw joint angles onto the follower "
"with no re-anchoring or clutch, so resuming immediately after a reset would "
"snap the follower straight to wherever the physical leader arm currently is,"
" causing a sudden, large joint motion. Before pressing ``B`` to resume, move"
" the physical leader arm to match the follower's reset pose."
msgstr ""
"按 ``R`` 会重置环境， **同时暂停遥操作** "
"，不会自动恢复。这是有意设计的：该任务的关节遥操作流水线直接将主控臂原始关节角映射到从动臂，不做重新锚定，也没有离合控制。重置后立即恢复，会让从动臂突然移动到真实主控臂的当前位置，产生幅度较大的关节运动。按"
" ``B`` 恢复前，请先移动真实主控臂，使它与从动臂的重置姿态一致。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:616
msgid ""
"Move the physical SO-101 leader arm and the simulated follower will mirror "
"its joint angles in real time. To record demonstrations from this task, run "
"``scripts/tools/record_demos.py`` with the same ``--task`` and the plugin "
"running in its second terminal -- see `Data Collection in Sim`_ for the full"
" recording workflow and runtime troubleshooting."
msgstr ""
"移动真实 SO-101 主控臂，仿真从动臂会实时跟随其关节角。要录制该任务的示范，请用相同的 ``--task`` 运行 "
"``scripts/tools/record_demos.py`` ，并在另一个终端保持插件运行。完整录制流程及运行时故障排查见 `仿真中的数据采集 "
"<Data Collection in Sim_>`_ 。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:623
msgid ""
"After stacking the cube, open the gripper **all the way** before ending the "
"episode. The task's success check requires the gripper to be fully open -- a"
" partially open gripper holding position on top of the stack will not "
"register as success, even if the cube is correctly placed."
msgstr ""
"堆好立方体后，请在结束回合前将夹爪 **完全打开** "
"。任务的成功判定要求夹爪全开；即使立方体已正确放置，夹爪仅部分打开并停在堆叠上方，也不会被判定为成功。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:631
msgid "Retargeting Framework"
msgstr "重定向框架"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:633
msgid ""
"Isaac Capture uses a graph-based retargeting pipeline. Data flows from "
"**source nodes** through **retargeters** and is combined into a single "
"action tensor."
msgstr "Isaac Capture 使用基于计算图的重定向流水线。数据从 **源节点** 流经 **重定向器** ，最终合并为一个动作张量。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:637
msgid "Source Nodes"
msgstr "源节点"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:639
msgid ""
"``HandsSource`` -- provides hand tracking data (left/right, 26 joints each)."
msgstr "``HandsSource`` ：提供手部跟踪数据，左右手各 26 个关节。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:640
msgid ""
"``ControllersSource`` -- provides motion controller data (grip pose, "
"trigger, thumbstick, etc.)."
msgstr "``ControllersSource`` ：提供运动控制器数据，包括握持位姿、扳机、摇杆等。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:643
msgid "Available Retargeters"
msgstr "可用的重定向器"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:645
msgid ""
"Retargeters are provided by the ``isaacteleop`` package from the `Isaac "
"Capture <https://github.com/NVIDIA/IsaacCapture>`_ repository. The "
"retargeters listed below are those used by the built-in Isaac Lab "
"environments. Isaac Capture may offer additional retargeters not listed here"
" -- refer to the `Isaac Capture repository "
"<https://github.com/NVIDIA/IsaacCapture>`_ for the full set."
msgstr ""
"重定向器由 `Isaac Capture <https://github.com/NVIDIA/IsaacCapture>`_ 仓库的 "
"``isaacteleop`` 包提供。以下列出 Isaac Lab 内置环境使用的重定向器。Isaac Capture "
"可能提供其他未列出的重定向器，完整列表见 `Isaac Capture 仓库 "
"<https://github.com/NVIDIA/IsaacCapture>`_ 。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:0
msgid "Se3AbsRetargeter / Se3RelRetargeter"
msgstr "Se3AbsRetargeter / Se3RelRetargeter"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:653
msgid ""
"Maps hand or controller tracking to end-effector pose. ``Se3AbsRetargeter`` "
"outputs a 7D absolute pose (position + quaternion). ``Se3RelRetargeter`` "
"outputs a 6D delta. Configurable rotation offsets (roll, pitch, yaw in "
"degrees)."
msgstr ""
"将手部或控制器跟踪数据映射到末端执行器位姿。 ``Se3AbsRetargeter`` 输出 7 维绝对位姿（位置 + 四元数）， "
"``Se3RelRetargeter`` 输出 6 维增量。可配置旋转偏移（以度为单位的滚转、俯仰、偏航角）。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:0
msgid "GripperRetargeter"
msgstr "GripperRetargeter"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:659
msgid ""
"Outputs a single float (-1.0 closed, 1.0 open). Uses controller trigger "
"(priority) or thumb-index pinch distance from hand tracking."
msgstr "输出单个浮点数（-1.0 为闭合，1.0 为打开）。优先使用控制器扳机，也可使用手部跟踪中的拇指与食指捏合距离。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:0
msgid "DexHandRetargeter / DexBiManualRetargeter"
msgstr "DexHandRetargeter / DexBiManualRetargeter"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:664
msgid ""
"Retargets full hand tracking (26 joints) to robot-specific hand joint angles"
" using the ``dex-retargeting`` library. Requires a robot hand URDF and a "
"YAML configuration file."
msgstr ""
"通过 ``dex-retargeting`` 库，将完整的 26 关节手部跟踪数据重定向为特定机器人手的关节角。需要机器人手的 URDF 及 YAML "
"配置文件。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:669
msgid ""
"The links used for retargeting must be defined at the actual fingertips, not"
" in the middle of the fingers, to ensure accurate optimization."
msgstr "用于重定向的连杆必须定义在真实指尖处，而非手指中部，以保证优化准确。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:0
msgid "TriHandMotionControllerRetargeter"
msgstr "TriHandMotionControllerRetargeter"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:674
msgid ""
"Maps VR controller buttons (trigger, squeeze) to G1 TriHand joints (7 DOF "
"per hand). Simple mapping: trigger controls the index finger, squeeze "
"controls the middle finger, and both together control the thumb."
msgstr ""
"将 VR 控制器按钮（扳机、握持按钮）映射到 G1 TriHand 关节，每只手 7 "
"自由度。映射方式简单：扳机控制食指，握持按钮控制中指，两者同时按下控制拇指。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:0
msgid "LocomotionRootCmdRetargeter"
msgstr "LocomotionRootCmdRetargeter"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:680
msgid ""
"Maps controller thumbsticks to a 4D locomotion command: ``[vel_x, vel_y, "
"rot_vel_z, hip_height]``."
msgstr "将控制器摇杆映射为 4 维移动命令： ``[vel_x, vel_y, rot_vel_z, hip_height]`` 。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:0
msgid "TensorReorderer"
msgstr "TensorReorderer"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:685
msgid ""
"Utility that flattens and reorders outputs from multiple retargeters into a "
"single 1D action tensor. The ``output_order`` must match the action space "
"expected by the environment."
msgstr "将多个重定向器的输出展平并重新排序，组成单个一维动作张量。 ``output_order`` 必须与环境要求的动作空间一致。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:688
msgid "The built-in Isaac Lab environments use these retargeters as follows:"
msgstr "Isaac Lab 内置环境按以下方式使用重定向器："

