#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:734
msgid ""
"**Arm:** right controller grip pose drives end-effector. **Gripper:** right "
"trigger."
msgstr "**机械臂：** 右控制器握持位姿驱动末端执行器。 **夹爪：** 右扳机。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:736
