msgstr "``IsaacContrib-ExhaustPipe-GR1T2-Pink-IK-Abs``"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:759
msgid "``IsaacContrib-PickPlace-G1-InspireFTP-Abs``"
msgstr "``IsaacContrib-PickPlace-G1-InspireFTP-Abs``"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:762
msgid ""
"**Arms:** left/right hand wrist pose drives each end-effector. **Hands:** "
"full 26-joint hand tracking retargeted to 12 DOF per Inspire hand via "
"``DexHandRetargeter``."
msgstr ""
"**机械臂：** 左右手手腕位姿分别驱动对应末端执行器。 **手：** 完整的 26 关节手部跟踪数据通过 ``DexHandRetargeter`` "
"重定向到每只 Inspire 手的 12 个自由度。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:764 source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1398
msgid "``IsaacContrib-PickPlace-FixedBaseUpperBodyIK-G1-Abs``"
msgstr "``IsaacContrib-PickPlace-FixedBaseUpperBodyIK-G1-Abs``"

