msgid ""
"**Arms:** left/right controller grip pose drives each end-effector. "
"**Hands:** trigger closes index, squeeze closes middle, both together close "
"thumb (7 DOF TriHand per hand)."
msgstr ""
"**机械臂：** 左右控制器握持位姿分别驱动对应末端执行器。 **手：** 扳机闭合食指，握持按钮闭合中指，两者同时按下闭合拇指；每只 TriHand "
"有 7 个自由度。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:769 source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1397
msgid "``IsaacContrib-PickPlace-Locomanipulation-G1-Abs``"
msgstr "``IsaacContrib-PickPlace-Locomanipulation-G1-Abs``"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:772
msgid ""
"**Arms:** same as fixed-base G1 above. **Hands:** same TriHand mapping. "
"**Locomotion:** left thumbstick = linear velocity (x/y), right thumbstick X "
"= rotational velocity, right thumbstick Y = hip height."
msgstr ""
"**机械臂：** 与上述固定基座 G1 相同。 **手：** 使用相同 TriHand 映射。 **移动：** 左摇杆控制线速度（x/y），右摇杆 X "
"控制转动速度，右摇杆 Y 控制髋部高度。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:778
msgid ""
"**Controllers** provide a grip pose plus physical buttons (trigger, squeeze,"
" thumbstick), ideal for tasks that need a gripper or simple hand mapping. "
"**Hand tracking** captures 26 wrist and finger joints per hand, required for"
" dexterous retargeting to complex robot hands."
msgstr ""
"**控制器** 提供握持位姿及实体按钮（扳机、握持按钮、摇杆），适合需要夹爪或简单手部映射的任务。 **手部跟踪** 采集每只手的 26 "
"个手腕和手指关节，是复杂机器人手灵巧重定向所必需的数据。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:783
msgid "Keyboard and SpaceMouse Environments"
msgstr "键盘与 SpaceMouse 环境"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:787
msgid ""
"Keyboard and SpaceMouse teleoperation uses the legacy native Isaac Lab "
"teleop stack (``isaaclab.devices``), not Isaac Capture. These environments "
"do not require an XR headset."
msgstr ""
"键盘和 SpaceMouse 遥操作使用原有的 Isaac Lab 原生遥操作组件（ ``isaaclab.devices`` ），不使用 Isaac "
"Capture。这些环境无需 XR 头显。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:790
msgid ""
"The device button layouts below apply to all environments in this section. "
"Per-environment differences (gripper enabled/disabled, sensitivity) are "
"noted in the environment table that follows."
msgstr "以下设备按键布局适用于本节所有环境。各环境的差异，如夹爪是否启用、灵敏度设置，见后面的环境表。"

