msgstr "**机械臂：** 相对 Newton IK 末端控制。夹爪禁用。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:930
msgid ""
"Humanoid arms (e.g. Galbot, Agibot) have joint limits that inverse "
"kinematics must respect. The differential IK controller ignores these "
"limits, so RMPFlow is preferred for teleoperating them as it enforces joint "
"limits while solving IK. Consequently, the arm may occasionally stop "
"responding when the commanded target pose is unreachable within those limits"
" -- this is expected, not a bug."
msgstr ""
"人形机器人机械臂（如 Galbot、Agibot）存在逆向运动学必须遵守的关节限位。微分 IK 控制器忽略这些限位，因此遥操作时更推荐 "
"RMPFlow，它在求解 IK 时会约束关节范围。由此，目标位姿在限位内不可达时，机械臂偶尔会停止响应；这是预期行为，并非错误。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:937
msgid "Leader-Arm Environments"
msgstr "主控臂环境"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:939
msgid ""
"These environments are driven by a physical *leader* arm that streams joint "
"angles over the Isaac Capture tensor transport; the angles are mirrored "
"directly onto the simulated follower with no XR headset or inverse "
"kinematics. See :ref:`Example: SO-101 leader-arm joint teleoperation <isaac-"
"teleop-so101-leader-example>` above for the run command and pipeline."
msgstr ""
"这些环境由真实的 *主控臂* 驱动，通过 Isaac Capture 张量传输通道发送关节角，直接映射到仿真从动臂，无需 XR "
"头显或逆向运动学。运行命令及流水线见上文 :ref:`示例：SO-101 主控臂关节遥操作 <isaac-teleop-so101-leader-"
"example>` 。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:952
msgid ""
"``IsaacContrib-Stack-Cube-SO101-Joint-Teleop-v0`` with "
"``physics=isaacsim_physx``"
msgstr ""
"``IsaacContrib-Stack-Cube-SO101-Joint-Teleop-v0`` ，使用 "
"``physics=isaacsim_physx``"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:953
msgid "SO-101 leader arm"
msgstr "SO-101 主控臂"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:954
msgid ""
"**Arm + gripper:** the leader arm's six joint angles (five arm DOF + "
"gripper) are mirrored onto the follower via ``JointStateRetargeter`` "
"(``mode=\"joint\"``)."
msgstr ""
"**机械臂 + 夹爪：** 主控臂的六个关节角（5 个机械臂自由度 + 夹爪）通过 ``JointStateRetargeter`` （ "
"``mode=\"joint\"`` ）映射到从动臂。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:960
msgid "Switch Between Controllers and Hand Tracking"
msgstr "在控制器与手部跟踪之间切换"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:962
msgid ""
"The retargeting pipeline determines whether an environment uses motion "
"controllers or hand tracking. Switching input modes requires changing the "
"``pipeline_builder`` function in your environment config. No other "
"environment-level changes are needed as long as the action space "
"(``TensorReorderer`` output order) stays the same."
msgstr ""
"重定向流水线决定环境采用运动控制器还是手部跟踪。切换输入模式需要修改环境配置的 ``pipeline_builder`` 函数。只要动作空间（ "
"``TensorReorderer`` 输出顺序）不变，就不需要其他环境级修改。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:967
msgid "**Controller to hand tracking**"
msgstr "**从控制器切换到手部跟踪**"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:969
msgid "The key changes are:"
msgstr "主要修改如下："

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:971
msgid ""
"Create a ``HandsSource`` and apply the world-to-anchor transform to it "
"(instead of ``ControllersSource``)."
msgstr "创建 ``HandsSource`` 并对其应用世界坐标系与锚点之间的变换，替代 ``ControllersSource`` 。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:973
msgid ""
"Point the ``Se3RetargeterConfig.input_device`` at the appropriate "
"``HandsSource`` key."
msgstr "将 ``Se3RetargeterConfig.input_device`` 指向对应的 ``HandsSource`` 键。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:974
msgid ""
"Set ``use_wrist_rotation=True`` and ``use_wrist_position=True`` so that the "
"SE3 retargeter reads from the hand wrist joint rather than the controller "
"grip pose."
msgstr ""
"设置 ``use_wrist_rotation=True`` 和 ``use_wrist_position=True`` ，使 SE3 "
"重定向器读取手腕关节，而非控制器握持位姿。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:976
msgid ""
"The ``GripperRetargeter`` already supports both inputs -- it uses the "
"controller trigger when connected to a ``ControllersSource`` or thumb-index "
"pinch when connected to a ``HandsSource``."
msgstr ""
"``GripperRetargeter`` 已支持两种输入：连接 ``ControllersSource`` 时使用控制器扳机，连接 "
"``HandsSource`` 时使用拇指与食指捏合。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:980
msgid ""
"Here is the Franka stack environment's controller-based pipeline alongside a"
" hand-tracking variant for comparison."
msgstr "以下并列展示 Franka 堆叠环境基于控制器的流水线及其手部跟踪变体，便于比较。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:983
msgid "**Original (controller-based):**"
msgstr "**原始版本（基于控制器）：**"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1002
msgid "**Modified (hand-tracking-based):**"
msgstr "**修改后（基于手部跟踪）：**"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1020
msgid ""
"The ``GripperRetargeter`` needs no changes -- it accepts both controller and"
" hand inputs and uses whichever source is connected."
msgstr "``GripperRetargeter`` 无需修改，它接受控制器和手部输入，并使用已连接的数据源。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1023
msgid "**Hand tracking to controller**"
msgstr "**从手部跟踪切换到控制器**"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1025
msgid ""
"Reverse the steps above: set ``input_device`` to a ``ControllersSource`` "
"key, transform the controllers instead of the hands, and set "
"``use_wrist_rotation=False`` and ``use_wrist_position=False``. Adjust "
"``target_offset_roll/pitch/yaw`` to account for the controller grip frame "
"orientation (typically 90 degrees roll for Franka-style grippers)."
msgstr ""
"反向执行上述步骤：将 ``input_device`` 设为 ``ControllersSource`` 的键，对控制器而非手部应用变换，设置 "
"``use_wrist_rotation=False`` 和 ``use_wrist_position=False`` 。调整 "
"``target_offset_roll/pitch/yaw`` ，补偿控制器握持坐标系的朝向；Franka 类夹爪通常需要 90 度滚转偏移。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1032
msgid ""
"When switching between input modes, you may need to tune the "
"``target_offset_roll``, ``target_offset_pitch``, and ``target_offset_yaw`` "
"values. Controller grip frames and hand wrist frames have different default "
"orientations relative to the robot end-effector."
msgstr ""
"切换输入模式时，可能需要调整 ``target_offset_roll`` 、 ``target_offset_pitch`` 和 "
"``target_offset_yaw`` 。相对于机器人末端执行器，控制器握持坐标系与手腕坐标系的默认朝向不同。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1040
msgid "Build a Retargeting Pipeline"
msgstr "构建重定向流水线"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1042
msgid ""
"A pipeline builder is a callable that constructs the retargeting graph and "
"returns an ``OutputCombiner`` with a single ``\"action\"`` key. Here is a "
"complete example for a Franka manipulator (from "
"``stack_ik_abs_env_cfg.py``):"
msgstr ""
"流水线构建器是一个可调用对象，负责构建重定向计算图，并返回仅包含 ``\"action\"`` 键的 ``OutputCombiner`` 。以下是 "
"Franka 机械臂的完整示例，来自 ``stack_ik_abs_env_cfg.py`` ："

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1106
msgid ""
"The ``output_order`` of the ``TensorReorderer`` must match the action space "
"of your environment. Mismatches will cause silent control errors."
msgstr "``TensorReorderer`` 的 ``output_order`` 必须与环境动作空间一致。不一致会导致控制错误，却不会报错。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1113
msgid "Configure Your Environment"
msgstr "配置环境"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1115
msgid ""
"Register the pipeline in your environment configuration using "
":class:`~isaaclab_teleop.IsaacTeleopCfg`:"
msgstr "通过 :class:`~isaaclab_teleop.IsaacTeleopCfg` 在环境配置中注册流水线："

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1135
msgid "Key ``IsaacTeleopCfg`` fields:"
msgstr "``IsaacTeleopCfg`` 的主要字段："

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1137
msgid ""
"``pipeline_builder`` -- callable that returns an ``OutputCombiner`` with an "
"``\"action\"`` output."
msgstr ""
"``pipeline_builder`` ：返回 ``OutputCombiner`` 的可调用对象，该对象包含 ``\"action\"`` 输出。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1138
msgid ""
"``retargeters_to_tune`` -- optional callable returning retargeters to expose"
" in the live tuning UI."
msgstr "``retargeters_to_tune`` ：可选的可调用对象，返回要在实时调参界面中显示的重定向器。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1139
msgid ""
"``xr_cfg`` -- :class:`~isaaclab_teleop.XrCfg` for anchor configuration (see "
"below)."
msgstr "``xr_cfg`` ：用于锚点配置的 :class:`~isaaclab_teleop.XrCfg` ，见下文。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1140
msgid ""
"``xr_camera_feeds`` -- ordered selection and per-feed panel settings for "
"existing task cameras. The list is empty by default, so tasks opt in to PiP "
"explicitly."
msgstr "``xr_camera_feeds`` ：按顺序选择现有任务相机，并设置各路画面的面板。列表默认为空，任务需显式启用画中画（PiP）。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1142
msgid ""
"``xr_camera_feed_layout`` -- viewer reference, fixed world pose, and manual,"
" horizontal, vertical, or grid panel packing."
msgstr "``xr_camera_feed_layout`` ：查看者参考位姿、固定世界位姿，以及手动、水平、垂直或网格面板布局。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1144
msgid ""
"``plugins`` -- list of Isaac Capture plugin configurations (e.g. Manus)."
msgstr "``plugins`` ：Isaac Capture 插件配置列表，如 Manus。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1145
msgid "``sim_device`` -- torch device string (default ``\"cuda:0\"``)."
msgstr "``sim_device`` ：torch 设备字符串，默认为 ``\"cuda:0\"`` 。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1146
msgid ""
"``retargeting_execution`` -- Isaac Capture retargeting execution settings. "
"Defaults to ``RetargetingExecutionConfig(mode=\"pipelined\")`` with "
"``DeadlinePacingConfig(safety_margin_s=0.025)`` so retargeting can run on "
"the Isaac Capture worker instead of blocking the simulation loop. The 25 ms "
"safety margin staggers Isaac Capture's Python work behind Isaac Lab's step "
"Python, giving native work such as rendering time to overlap instead of "
"having both Python stacks contend for the GIL at the start of the step."
msgstr ""
"``retargeting_execution`` ：Isaac Capture 重定向执行设置。默认使用 "
"``RetargetingExecutionConfig(mode=\"pipelined\")`` ，搭配 "
"``DeadlinePacingConfig(safety_margin_s=0.025)`` ，让重定向在 Isaac Capture "
"工作线程上运行，避免阻塞仿真循环。25 ms 安全余量使 Isaac Capture 的 Python 执行稍晚于 Isaac Lab 仿真步的 "
"Python 执行，让渲染等原生操作有机会并行，而非两套 Python 组件在仿真步开始时争用 GIL。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1157
msgid ""
"``pipeline_builder`` and ``retargeters_to_tune`` must be **callables** "
"(functions or lambdas), not pre-built objects. The ``@configclass`` "
"decorator deep-copies mutable attributes, which would break pre-built "
"pipeline graphs."
msgstr ""
"``pipeline_builder`` 和 ``retargeters_to_tune`` 必须是 **可调用对象** （函数或 "
"lambda），不能是预先构建的对象。 ``@configclass`` 装饰器会深拷贝可变属性，破坏预先构建的流水线计算图。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1165
msgid "CloudXR Environment Profiles"
msgstr "CloudXR 环境配置文件"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1167
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab ships three ``.env`` profiles that configure the CloudXR runtime "
"-- two for XR devices and one for headless standalone use. These are bundled"
" inside the ``isaaclab_teleop`` package and can be referenced via constants:"
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 附带三份配置 CloudXR 运行时的 ``.env`` 文件，两份用于 XR 设备，一份用于无界面的独立模式。它们包含在 "
"``isaaclab_teleop`` 包中，可通过常量引用："

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1175
