msgstr "``auto-webrtc``"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1183 source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1184
#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1188 source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1189
#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1193 source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1194
msgid "``0``"
msgstr "``0``"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1185
msgid ":data:`~isaaclab_teleop.CLOUDXR_AVP_ENV`"
msgstr ":data:`~isaaclab_teleop.CLOUDXR_AVP_ENV`"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1186
msgid "``avp-cloudxr.env``"
msgstr "``avp-cloudxr.env``"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1187
msgid "``auto-native``"
msgstr "``auto-native``"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1190
msgid ":data:`~isaaclab_teleop.CLOUDXR_STANDALONE_ENV`"
msgstr ":data:`~isaaclab_teleop.CLOUDXR_STANDALONE_ENV`"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1191
msgid "``cloudxr-standalone.env``"
msgstr "``cloudxr-standalone.env``"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1192
msgid "``quest3``"
msgstr "``quest3``"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1196
msgid ""
"All three profiles set ``NV_CXR_ENABLE_PUSH_DEVICES=0``, which is correct "
"for headset optical hand tracking (the most common setup). For external "
"push-device peripherals such as Manus gloves, set this to ``1`` in a custom "
"profile (see below). They also set ``NV_ENABLE_POSE_WAIT=0`` so CloudXR does"
" not throttle the application when frame times spike. This favors lower "
"latency over CloudXR's pose-wait smoothing."
msgstr ""
"三份配置均设置 ``NV_CXR_ENABLE_PUSH_DEVICES=0`` ，适用于头显光学手部跟踪这一最常见配置。对于 Manus "
"手套等主动推送数据的外部设备，请在自定义配置中改为 ``1`` ，见下文。它们也设置 ``NV_ENABLE_POSE_WAIT=0`` "
"，防止帧耗时突增时 CloudXR 限制应用速度。这优先保证低延迟，而非采用 CloudXR 的位姿等待平滑机制。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1202
msgid ""
":data:`~isaaclab_teleop.CLOUDXR_STANDALONE_ENV` is the default when running "
"**without** ``--xr`` (see :ref:`isaac-teleop-standalone`). It pins an "
"emulated ``quest3`` device profile so a CloudXR runtime with no client still"
" advertises an OpenXR system, working around "
"``XR_ERROR_FORM_FACTOR_UNAVAILABLE``."
msgstr ""
"**不使用** ``--xr`` 时，默认采用 :data:`~isaaclab_teleop.CLOUDXR_STANDALONE_ENV` （见 "
":ref:`isaac-teleop-standalone` ）。它固定使用模拟的 ``quest3`` 设备配置，使没有客户端连接的 CloudXR "
"运行时仍能报告 OpenXR 系统，避开 ``XR_ERROR_FORM_FACTOR_UNAVAILABLE`` 。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1208
msgid "Override at launch time"
msgstr "启动时覆盖配置"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1210
msgid ""
"The ``--cloudxr_env`` flag on ``teleop_se3_agent.py`` and "
"``record_demos.py`` selects which ``.env`` profile to use. When unset it "
"defaults to ``cloudxrjs`` (Quest/Pico) with ``--xr`` and ``standalone`` "
"without ``--xr``. Use the ``avp`` shorthand for Apple Vision Pro, "
"``standalone`` for the headless profile, or pass a full file path for a "
"custom profile:"
msgstr ""
"``teleop_se3_agent.py`` 和 ``record_demos.py`` 的 ``--cloudxr_env`` 标志选择 "
"``.env`` 配置文件。未设置时，使用 ``--xr`` 默认采用 ``cloudxrjs`` （Quest/Pico），不使用则采用 "
"``standalone`` 。Apple Vision Pro 可使用 ``avp`` 简写，无界面配置可使用 ``standalone`` "
"，自定义配置可传入完整文件路径："

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1238
msgid "Create a custom profile"
msgstr "创建自定义配置"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1240
msgid "Copy a shipped profile and edit it:"
msgstr "复制附带的配置文件并编辑："

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1248
msgid ""
"Edit ``~/my-cloudxr.env`` to change any values (e.g. "
"``NV_CXR_ENABLE_PUSH_DEVICES=1`` for Manus gloves), then pass it via "
"``--cloudxr_env ~/my-cloudxr.env``."
msgstr ""
"编辑 ``~/my-cloudxr.env`` ，修改所需值，如为 Manus 手套设置 "
"``NV_CXR_ENABLE_PUSH_DEVICES=1`` ，然后通过 ``--cloudxr_env ~/my-cloudxr.env`` "
"传入。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1252
msgid "Disable auto-launch"
msgstr "关闭自动启动"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1254
msgid ""
"If you prefer to run the CloudXR runtime manually in a separate terminal "
"(``python -m isaacteleop.cloudxr``), you can disable auto-launch in several "
"ways:"
msgstr ""
"如果希望在另一终端手动运行 CloudXR 运行时（ ``python -m isaacteleop.cloudxr`` "
"），可通过以下方式关闭自动启动："

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1257
msgid "**CLI flag**: ``--no-auto_launch_cloudxr`` on the teleop script."
msgstr "**命令行标志** ：遥操作脚本的 ``--no-auto_launch_cloudxr`` 。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1258
msgid "**Disable CloudXR entirely**: ``--cloudxr_env none``."
msgstr "**完全禁用 CloudXR** ： ``--cloudxr_env none`` 。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1259
msgid ""
"**Environment variable**: ``ISAACLAB_CXR_SKIP_AUTOLAUNCH=1`` overrides the "
"CLI flag at runtime."
msgstr "**环境变量** ： ``ISAACLAB_CXR_SKIP_AUTOLAUNCH=1`` 在运行时覆盖命令行标志。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1296
msgid "Accept the CloudXR license non-interactively"
msgstr "非交互式接受 CloudXR 许可证"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1298
msgid ""
"The NVIDIA CloudXR license is separate from the Omniverse one. The first "
"time the runtime starts it asks for it on stdin:"
msgstr "NVIDIA CloudXR 许可证与 Omniverse 许可证相互独立。运行时首次启动会从标准输入请求接受许可证："

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1307
msgid ""
"There is no terminal to answer on in a headless, container or CI run, so the"
" launch fails with ``RuntimeError: CloudXR EULA was not accepted; cannot "
"start the runtime``. Set ``ISAACLAB_CXR_ACCEPT_EULA=1`` to accept it up "
"front, the same way ``OMNI_KIT_ACCEPT_EULA`` works for the Omniverse "
"license:"
msgstr ""
"无界面、容器或 CI 运行中没有终端可响应，启动会失败并报 ``RuntimeError: CloudXR EULA was not accepted;"
" cannot start the runtime`` 。设置 ``ISAACLAB_CXR_ACCEPT_EULA=1`` 可预先接受许可证，方式与 "
"Omniverse 许可证的 ``OMNI_KIT_ACCEPT_EULA`` 相同："

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1318
msgid ""
"``y``, ``yes`` and ``1`` accept it, case-insensitively and ignoring "
"surrounding whitespace -- the same spellings ``OMNI_KIT_ACCEPT_EULA`` takes;"
" leaving the variable unset, or setting any other value, keeps the "
"interactive prompt. Acceptance is recorded in "
"``~/.cloudxr/run/eula_accepted``, so once the license has been accepted -- "
"interactively or through this variable -- later runs no longer prompt. The "
"variable applies to every script that launches the runtime, including the "
"process-scoped launcher in ``teleop_replay_agent.py``."
msgstr ""
"``y`` 、 ``yes`` 和 ``1`` 表示接受，不区分大小写，忽略首尾空白，与 ``OMNI_KIT_ACCEPT_EULA`` "
"的取值相同。未设置变量或设为其他值时，仍保留交互提示。接受记录存储在 ``~/.cloudxr/run/eula_accepted`` "
"；一旦通过交互或此变量接受许可证，后续运行就不再询问。该变量适用于所有启动运行时的脚本，包括 ``teleop_replay_agent.py`` "
"中进程级的启动器。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1329
msgid "Configure the XR Anchor"
msgstr "配置 XR 锚点"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1331
msgid ""
"The :class:`~isaaclab_teleop.XrCfg` controls how the simulation is "
"positioned and oriented in the XR device's view."
msgstr ":class:`~isaaclab_teleop.XrCfg` 控制仿真在 XR 设备视野中的位置和朝向。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1334
msgid "``anchor_pos`` / ``anchor_rot``"
msgstr "``anchor_pos`` / ``anchor_rot``"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1335
msgid ""
"Static anchor placement. The simulation point at these coordinates appears "
"at the XR device's local origin (floor level). Set to a point on the floor "
"beneath the robot to position it in front of the user."
msgstr "静态锚点位置。仿真中位于这些坐标的点，会出现在 XR 设备的局部原点（地面高度）。将其设为机器人下方的地面点，可把机器人放到用户面前。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1339
msgid "``anchor_prim_path``"
msgstr "``anchor_prim_path``"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1340
msgid ""
"Attach the anchor to a USD prim for dynamic positioning. Use this for "
"locomotion tasks where the robot moves and the XR camera should follow."
msgstr "将锚点附着到 USD prim，实现动态定位。适用于机器人移动、XR 相机需要跟随的运动任务。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1343
msgid "``anchor_rotation_mode``"
msgstr "``anchor_rotation_mode``"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1344
msgid "Controls how anchor rotation behaves:"
msgstr "控制锚点旋转行为："

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1350
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "模式"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1352
msgid "``FIXED``"
msgstr "``FIXED``"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1353
msgid ""
"Sets rotation once from ``anchor_rot``. Best for static manipulation setups."
msgstr "根据 ``anchor_rot`` 设置一次旋转，适合静态操作场景。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1354
msgid "``FOLLOW_PRIM``"
msgstr "``FOLLOW_PRIM``"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1355
msgid ""
"Rotation continuously tracks the attached prim. Best for locomotion where "
"the user should face the robot's heading direction."
msgstr "旋转持续跟随所附着的 prim，适合用户应面向机器人前进方向的运动任务。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1357
msgid "``FOLLOW_PRIM_SMOOTHED``"
msgstr "``FOLLOW_PRIM_SMOOTHED``"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1358
msgid ""
"Same as ``FOLLOW_PRIM`` with slerp interpolation. Controlled by "
"``anchor_rotation_smoothing_time`` (seconds, default 1.0). Reduces motion "
"sickness from abrupt rotation changes. Typical range: 0.3--1.5 s."
msgstr ""
"与 ``FOLLOW_PRIM`` 相同，但使用球面线性插值（slerp）。由 ``anchor_rotation_smoothing_time`` "
"控制，单位为秒，默认为 1.0。可减轻旋转突变引起的晕动不适，典型范围为 0.3–1.5 秒。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1361
msgid "``CUSTOM``"
msgstr "``CUSTOM``"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1362
msgid ""
"User-provided callable ``anchor_rotation_custom_func(headpose, primpose) -> "
"quaternion`` for fully custom logic."
msgstr ""
"用户提供的可调用对象 ``anchor_rotation_custom_func(headpose, primpose) -> quaternion``"
" ，用于完全自定义逻辑。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1365
msgid "``fixed_anchor_height``"
msgstr "``fixed_anchor_height``"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1366
msgid ""
"When ``True`` (default), keeps the anchor height at its initial value. "
"Prevents vertical bobbing during locomotion."
msgstr "为 ``True`` （默认）时，锚点高度保持初始值，避免运动过程中上下起伏。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1369
msgid "``near_plane``"
msgstr "``near_plane``"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1370
msgid "Closest render distance for the XR device (default 0.15 m)."
msgstr "XR 设备的最近渲染距离，默认为 0.15 m。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1374
msgid ""
"On Apple Vision Pro, the local coordinate frame can be reset to a point on "
"the floor beneath the user by holding the digital crown."
msgstr "在 Apple Vision Pro 上，本地坐标系可以通过按住数字表冠重置到用户下方的地板上的位置。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1379
msgid ""
"Camera sensors add GPU cost. Strip them with ``--disable_external_cameras`` "
"when the workflow needs neither image observations nor XR camera feedback. "
"That flag also skips configured PiP feeds."
msgstr ""
"相机传感器会增加 GPU 开销。工作流既不需要图像观测，也不需要 XR 相机反馈时，可用 ``--disable_external_cameras`` "
"移除它们；该标志也会跳过已配置的画中画画面。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1387
msgid "XR Camera Feedback"
msgstr "XR 相机反馈"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1389
msgid ""
"An ordered list of :class:`~isaaclab_teleop.XrCameraFeedCfg` objects selects"
" existing task scene cameras. The manager publishes each new RGBA frame "
"after rendering, while :class:`~isaaclab_teleop.XrCameraFeedLayoutCfg` "
"places the panels manually or in horizontal, vertical, and grid layouts. The"
" following registered tasks enable PiP by default:"
msgstr ""
"有序的 :class:`~isaaclab_teleop.XrCameraFeedCfg` "
"对象列表用于选择任务场景中现有的相机。管理器在渲染后发布每个新 RGBA 帧， "
":class:`~isaaclab_teleop.XrCameraFeedLayoutCfg` "
"则按手动、水平、垂直或网格布局放置面板。以下已注册任务默认启用画中画："

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1400
msgid ""
"Both G1 tasks present the calibrated head camera in a ``head_locked`` panel "
"that follows headset position and orientation. Locomanipulation retains the "
"camera as a recorded policy observation; fixed-base G1 uses it only for PiP "
"and keeps its policy observation schema unchanged."
msgstr ""
"两个 G1 任务都在 ``head_locked`` "
"面板中显示已校准的头部相机画面，面板随头显位置和朝向移动。移动操作任务保留相机作为录制的策略观测；固定基座 G1 仅将其用于画中画，策略观测结构不变。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1404
msgid ""
"To run fixed-base G1 upper-body teleoperation with its default head-locked "
"PiP:"
msgstr "使用默认的头部锁定画中画运行固定基座 G1 上半身遥操作："

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1412
msgid ""
"This task uses motion controllers for the arms and TriHand fingers while the"
" robot root remains fixed. The panel follows the headset, but its image "
"comes from the robot's head camera, not the headset view. ``--device cpu`` "
"selects CPU simulation; camera rendering and CloudXR encoding still use the "
"GPU."
msgstr ""
"此任务使用运动控制器操纵机械臂及 TriHand 手指，机器人根部保持固定。面板跟随头显，但画面来自机器人头部相机，而非头显视图。 ``--device"
" cpu`` 选择 CPU 仿真，相机渲染和 CloudXR 编码仍使用 GPU。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1417
msgid ""
"``teleop_se3_agent.py`` and ``record_demos.py`` show every enabled feed when"
" an Isaac Capture-enabled environment runs with ``--xr``. PiP is absent "
"unless the task explicitly selects an existing ``CameraCfg`` through "
"``xr_camera_feeds``. Except for fixed-base G1, the selected "
"``robot_pov_cam`` is also a policy image observation, so the normal "
"demonstration recorder stores the same view shown to the operator. Each "
"camera is parented to a physical robot body link, so the camera view follows"
" robot motion:"
msgstr ""
"启用 Isaac Capture 的环境使用 ``--xr`` 运行时， ``teleop_se3_agent.py`` 和 "
"``record_demos.py`` 会显示所有已启用的画面。只有任务通过 ``xr_camera_feeds`` 显式选择现有的 "
"``CameraCfg`` 时，才会显示画中画。除固定基座 G1 外，被选中的 ``robot_pov_cam`` "
"也作为策略图像观测，因此常规示范录制器会保存与操作者看到的相同画面。每个相机都以机器人的实体连杆为父对象，因此视图随机器人运动："

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1424
msgid ""
"XR teleoperation view with the robot point-of-view camera shown in a "
"picture-in-picture panel"
msgstr "XR 遥操作视图，画中画面板显示机器人视角相机画面"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1428
msgid ""
"Robot point-of-view camera feedback shown as a picture-in-picture panel "
"during XR teleoperation."
msgstr "XR 遥操作期间，以画中画面板显示机器人视角相机反馈。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1432
msgid ""
"Without scene-partition isolation, a PiP panel entering its source camera's "
"field of view produces a recursive hall-of-mirrors effect. Move the panel or"
" reorient the camera to keep the panel outside the camera's field of view."
msgstr "没有场景分区隔离时，画中画面板进入其源相机视野，会产生递归的镜中镜效果。请移动面板或调整相机朝向，让面板保持在相机视野之外。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1436
msgid ""
"Both G1 tasks enable "
":attr:`~isaaclab_teleop.XrCameraFeedLayoutCfg.use_scene_partition` to avoid "
"this recursion. Before environment construction, preparation temporarily "
"disables per-environment partitioning on selected Isaac RTX camera "
"renderers. Binding sets "
"``/rtx/scenePartitioning/showAllPartitionsByDefault=False`` after renderer "
"initialization and before creating panels. Geometry must start as shared, "
"unpartitioned background; clearing its partition after camera initialization"
" can hide it from XR. Other scene cameras must also set "
"``enable_scene_partitioning=False``."
msgstr ""
"两个 G1 任务都启用 "
":attr:`~isaaclab_teleop.XrCameraFeedLayoutCfg.use_scene_partition` "
"，避免递归。环境构造前的准备阶段，会暂时禁用所选 Isaac RTX 相机渲染器的逐环境分区。绑定阶段在渲染器初始化后、创建面板前，将 "
"``/rtx/scenePartitioning/showAllPartitionsByDefault=False`` "
"。几何体一开始必须是共享且未分区的背景；相机初始化后才清除其分区，可能导致它在 XR 中不可见。其他场景相机也必须设置 "
"``enable_scene_partitioning=False`` 。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1444
msgid ""
"The SceneUI adapter assigns the XR camera and ``/ui`` to "
"``isaaclab_teleop_xr_camera_pip`` and refreshes inheritance when SceneUI "
"children appear. Robot cameras see shared background without UI; XR sees "
"both. XR/UI overrides use the session layer. Prior camera, renderer, and "
"partition settings are restored after their final owner closes, unless "
"changed externally. Camera configuration is restored after the last prepared"
" session closes; the global setting's bind-time value is restored after the "
"last bound session closes. Prepared sessions must close even if environment "
"construction fails; the teleoperation and recording scripts handle this "
"cleanup. Panels remain hidden while tracking or isolation is unavailable and"
" reappear after recovery. Other tasks retain their existing behavior because"
" ``use_scene_partition`` defaults to ``False``."
msgstr ""
"SceneUI 适配器将 XR 相机和 ``/ui`` 分配到 ``isaaclab_teleop_xr_camera_pip`` ，在 SceneUI"
" 子对象出现时刷新继承。机器人相机看到不含 UI 的共享背景，XR 则同时看到两者。XR/UI "
"覆盖写入会话层。最后一个使用者关闭后，原先的相机、渲染器和分区设置会恢复，除非期间被外部修改。最后一个完成准备的会话关闭后恢复相机配置；最后一个已绑定会话关闭后，将全局设置恢复为绑定时的值。即使环境构造失败，已准备的会话也必须关闭；遥操作与录制脚本会处理这项清理。跟踪或隔离不可用时，面板保持隐藏，恢复后重新显示。其他任务保留原有行为，因为"
" ``use_scene_partition`` 默认为 ``False`` 。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1461
msgid ""
"XR camera PiP currently supports exactly one environment. When a task has "
"enabled PiP feeds, startup rejects ``--num_envs`` values other than ``1``; "
"Isaac Capture XR behavior without PiP is unchanged. For either G1 task, set "
"``env.isaac_teleop.xr_camera_feeds=[]`` to disable PiP and retain the camera"
" sensor and any configured camera observations."
msgstr ""
"XR 相机画中画目前仅支持一个环境。任务启用画中画时，启动阶段会拒绝任何不为 ``1`` 的 ``--num_envs`` "
"值；不使用画中画时，Isaac Capture XR 的行为不变。对于两个 G1 任务，都可设置 "
"``env.isaac_teleop.xr_camera_feeds=[]`` 来关闭画中画，同时保留相机传感器及已配置的相机观测。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1466
msgid ""
"The reference feeds request render-product-local DLSS Ray Reconstruction and"
" ``quality`` execution mode through "
":class:`~isaaclab_teleop.XrCameraFeedCfg`. The private PiP adapter authors "
"those two attributes only on the selected camera render product. Ray "
"Reconstruction also requires the process-global responsive-denoising "
"setting, which the teleoperation and recording scripts enable before "
"environment construction when a selected feed requests Ray Reconstruction."
msgstr ""
"参考画面配置通过 :class:`~isaaclab_teleop.XrCameraFeedCfg` 请求渲染产物局部的 DLSS 光线重建，以及 "
"``quality`` "
"执行模式。内部画中画适配器只在所选相机的渲染产物上写入这两个属性。光线重建还需要进程全局的响应式降噪设置；所选画面请求光线重建时，遥操作和录制脚本会在构造环境前启用它。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1473
msgid "Camera selection"
msgstr "相机选择"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1475
msgid ""
"Tasks declare their default selection through "
"``IsaacTeleopCfg.xr_camera_feeds``:"
msgstr "任务通过 ``IsaacTeleopCfg.xr_camera_feeds`` 声明默认选择："

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1493
msgid ""
"For a recorded training view, define the named ``CameraCfg`` in the task "
"scene and a matching ``mdp.image_rgb`` term in ``observations.policy``. The "
"normal recorder then stores that observation, while the PiP declaration "
"above only selects it for presentation. Enabled task-declared entries "
"control camera selection, panel count, display order, and automatic-layout "
"order without mutating the reusable task configuration."
msgstr ""
"要录制训练视图，请在任务场景中定义命名的 ``CameraCfg`` ，并在 ``observations.policy`` 中定义匹配的 "
"``mdp.image_rgb`` "
"项。常规录制器随后会存储该观测，上面的画中画声明只负责选择显示内容。任务声明中已启用的条目控制相机选择、面板数量、显示顺序和自动布局顺序，不修改可复用的任务配置。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1500 source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1514
msgid "Placement"
msgstr "放置方式"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1502
msgid ""
"The default :attr:`~isaaclab_teleop.XrCameraFeedLayoutCfg.placement` is "
"``\"viewer_start\"``. The presenter waits for the first valid headset pose, "
"captures its eye position and upright yaw, then places the layout 0.8 m "
"ahead at eye height. That pose remains fixed in the world while the user "
"moves. Panels hide when the XR display disconnects and capture a new "
"starting pose after reconnect; resetting the environment does not recenter "
"them."
msgstr ""
"默认 :attr:`~isaaclab_teleop.XrCameraFeedLayoutCfg.placement` 为 "
"``\"viewer_start\"`` 。显示组件等待首个有效头显位姿，记录眼部位置和水平偏航角，再将布局放到眼睛高度、前方 0.8 m "
"处。用户移动时，该位姿仍固定在世界坐标系中。XR 显示断开时面板隐藏，重新连接后采集新的起始位姿；重置环境不会重新居中。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1508
msgid "Three placement references are available:"
msgstr "支持三种放置参考："

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1515
msgid "Behavior"
msgstr "行为"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1516
msgid "``viewer_start``"
msgstr "``viewer_start``"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1517
msgid ""
"Capture the first valid eye position and upright yaw, then keep the layout "
"world-static. This is the default."
msgstr "记录首个有效眼部位置及水平偏航角，然后将布局固定在世界坐标系中。这是默认方式。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1519
msgid "``head_locked``"
msgstr "``head_locked``"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1520
msgid ""
"Follow the current headset position and orientation with the configured "
"offset and distance."
msgstr "按所配置的偏移和距离，跟随当前头显位置及朝向。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1521
msgid "``world``"
msgstr "``world``"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1522
msgid ""
"Use ``world_position_m`` and ``world_orientation_xyzw`` as a fixed pose in "
"the Isaac Lab USD stage world. ``distance_m`` is unused."
msgstr ""
"以 ``world_position_m`` 和 ``world_orientation_xyzw`` 指定 Isaac Lab USD "
"舞台世界坐标系中的固定位姿。此时不使用 ``distance_m`` 。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1549
msgid ""
"``manual`` mode preserves each feed's ``offset_m`` and ``distance_m``. "
"``horizontal``, ``vertical``, and ``grid`` modes pack enabled feeds around "
"``center_offset_m`` using ``panel_gap_m``; grid mode also honors "
"``max_columns``. Offsets are measured in the selected layout plane. With "
"``viewer_start`` and ``head_locked``, ``distance_m`` places that plane in "
"front of the viewer reference. In manual mode, feeds with identical offsets "
"overlap; select an automatic mode or assign distinct feed offsets when "
"showing multiple panels."
msgstr ""
"``manual`` 模式保留各路画面的 ``offset_m`` 和 ``distance_m`` 。 ``horizontal`` 、 "
"``vertical`` 和 ``grid`` 模式根据 ``panel_gap_m`` ，围绕 ``center_offset_m`` "
"排列已启用的画面；网格模式还遵循 ``max_columns`` 。偏移在所选布局平面内测量。采用 ``viewer_start`` 和 "
"``head_locked`` 时， ``distance_m`` "
"将该平面放在查看者参考位置前方。手动模式下，相同偏移的画面会重叠；显示多个面板时，请选自动模式或分别设置不同偏移。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1556
msgid ""
"With ``world``, the explicit pose is measured in the Isaac Lab USD stage "
"world in meters, not OpenXR physical space. Isaac Lab stages are Z-up. "
"``world_orientation_xyzw`` maps panel-local coordinates into that world: "
"local +X is image right, local +Y is image up, and local +Z points from the "
"readable face toward the viewer. Feed and automatic-layout offsets are "
"applied in the panel's local XY plane."
msgstr ""
"采用 ``world`` 时，显式位姿以米为单位，定义在 Isaac Lab USD 舞台世界坐标系中，而非 OpenXR 物理空间。Isaac Lab"
" 舞台以 Z 轴朝上。 ``world_orientation_xyzw`` 将面板局部坐标映射到世界坐标系：局部 +X 指向图像右方，+Y "
"指向上方，+Z 从可读面朝向查看者。各路画面及自动布局的偏移都应用在面板局部 XY 平面内。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1563
msgid "Disable cameras and PiP"
msgstr "关闭相机与画中画"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1565
msgid ""
"Set :attr:`~isaaclab_teleop.XrCameraFeedCfg.enabled` to ``False`` to "
"suppress one feed, or set ``xr_camera_feeds=[]`` to suppress all PiP. The "
"list is empty by default. These choices do not remove camera sensors "
"independently owned by the task."
msgstr ""
"将 :attr:`~isaaclab_teleop.XrCameraFeedCfg.enabled` 设为 ``False`` 可隐藏一路画面，设置 "
"``xr_camera_feeds=[]`` 可隐藏全部画中画。列表默认为空。这些设置不会移除任务独立持有的相机传感器。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1569
msgid ""
"``--disable_external_cameras`` is the master camera-rendering switch for "
"``teleop_se3_agent.py`` and ``record_demos.py``. It strips camera sensors "
"and suppresses every configured PiP feed."
msgstr ""
"``--disable_external_cameras`` 是 ``teleop_se3_agent.py`` 和 "
"``record_demos.py`` 的相机渲染总开关，会移除相机传感器，并禁用所有已配置的画中画。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1573
msgid "Kit Scene UI presentation"
msgstr "Kit Scene UI 显示方式"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1575
msgid ""
"PiP presentation uses Kit Scene UI and ``SpatialSource`` placement. Kit "
"imports are deferred until an enabled feed is requested. If the Scene UI "
"modules cannot be imported, the scripts log a warning and continue without "
"PiP; task-owned cameras and recording observations remain unchanged. This "
"keeps the camera selection configuration usable when a future kitless entry "
"point no longer provides Scene UI. Render-product tuning is also best-"
"effort: backends without a compatible render product keep the Camera-buffer "
"path, and schema-authoring failures warn while PiP continues. Other "
"configuration, camera-buffer, and panel-initialization errors still fail "
"during startup."
msgstr ""
"画中画通过 Kit Scene UI 显示，并使用 ``SpatialSource`` 定位。只有请求已启用的画面时，才会导入 Kit 模块。如果 "
"Scene UI 模块无法导入，脚本会记录警告，继续运行但不显示画中画；任务自身的相机及录制观测不变。因此，未来不再提供 Scene UI 的无 Kit"
" 入口仍可使用相机选择配置。渲染产物调优也会尽可能应用：没有兼容渲染产物的后端保留 Camera "
"缓冲区方式，模式属性写入失败时发出警告，但画中画继续运行。其他配置、相机缓冲区及面板初始化错误仍会导致启动失败。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1587
msgid "Haptic Feedback"
msgstr "触觉反馈"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1589
msgid ""
"Isaac Capture can render **haptic feedback** on the operator's device from a"
" sim-side signal, closing the loop on grasp feel during teleoperation and "
"demonstration recording. Two backends ship today:"
msgstr ""
"Isaac Capture 可将仿真侧信号转换为操作者设备上的 **触觉反馈** ，在遥操作和示范录制时提供抓取感觉的闭环反馈。目前附带两种后端："

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1593
msgid ""
"**Controller vibration** -- a motion controller rumbles in proportion to the"
" total contact force on the corresponding robot hand."
msgstr "**控制器振动** ：运动控制器按对应机器人手的总接触力大小振动。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1595
msgid ""
"**Haptic glove** -- each finger of a haptic glove vibrates in proportion to "
"how tightly that finger grips the manipulated object."
msgstr "**触觉手套** ：每根手指按该手指抓紧被操作物体的程度振动。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1598
msgid ""
"Feedback is an *output* path that mirrors the input retargeting pipeline in "
"reverse. Each step, a :class:`~isaaclab_teleop.HapticFeedbackDriver` reads a"
" per-hand signal vector from the scene and pushes it to the "
":class:`~isaaclab_teleop.IsaacTeleopDevice`, which renders it through an "
"Isaac Capture ``HapticSink``. The signal-to-device mapping runs inside the "
"retargeting graph, so no device-specific code lives in your environment."
msgstr ""
"反馈是一条 *输出* 通路，可看作输入重定向流水线的反向映射。每步， "
":class:`~isaaclab_teleop.HapticFeedbackDriver` 从场景读取各只手的信号向量，并推送给 "
":class:`~isaaclab_teleop.IsaacTeleopDevice` ，后者通过 Isaac Capture 的 "
"``HapticSink`` 输出触觉反馈。信号到设备的映射在重定向计算图内运行，环境中无需包含设备专用代码。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1604
msgid ""
"The design keeps three concerns pluggable, so the same seam serves both "
"devices:"
msgstr "设计将三部分做成可替换组件，让同一接口适用于两种设备："

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1606
msgid ""
"**Signal source** -- how the per-hand vector is read from the environment."
msgstr "**信号源** ：如何从环境读取各只手的向量。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1607
msgid ""
"**Output port** -- the :class:`~isaaclab_teleop.HapticFeedbackReceiver` "
"protocol, whose payload is a *vector* (one scalar for a rumble motor, one "
"value per finger for a glove)."
msgstr ""
"**输出端口** ： :class:`~isaaclab_teleop.HapticFeedbackReceiver` 协议，传输的是 "
"*向量*，振动电机为一个标量，手套则每根手指一个值。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1609
msgid ""
"**Device backend** -- selected by the concrete "
":class:`~isaaclab_teleop.HapticFeedbackCfg` subclass, which wires the "
"retargeter and device behind the ``HapticSink``."
msgstr ""
"**设备后端** ：由具体的 :class:`~isaaclab_teleop.HapticFeedbackCfg` 子类选择，在 "
"``HapticSink`` 后连接重定向器和设备。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1612
msgid ""
"To enable feedback, add per-hand :class:`~isaaclab.sensors.ContactSensor` s "
"to the scene and attach a :class:`~isaaclab_teleop.HapticFeedbackCfg` "
"subclass as a sibling of ``isaac_teleop``. The teleop scripts "
"(``teleop_se3_agent.py`` and ``record_demos.py``) detect the "
"``haptic_feedback`` attribute automatically -- no extra flags are needed. If"
" the active device cannot render haptics (e.g. keyboard) or the env has no "
"``haptic_feedback``, the feature is silently skipped."
msgstr ""
"启用反馈时，为每只手在场景中添加 :class:`~isaaclab.sensors.ContactSensor` ，并将 "
":class:`~isaaclab_teleop.HapticFeedbackCfg` 子类配置放在与 ``isaac_teleop`` "
"同级的位置。遥操作脚本（ ``teleop_se3_agent.py`` 和 ``record_demos.py`` ）会自动检测 "
"``haptic_feedback`` 属性，无需额外标志。如果当前设备无法输出触觉反馈（如键盘），或环境没有 ``haptic_feedback`` "
"，则直接跳过该功能。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1619
msgid "Controller vibration"
msgstr "控制器振动"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1621
msgid ""
"Use :class:`~isaaclab_teleop.ControllerHapticFeedbackCfg`. It sums each "
"hand's contact force to a single amplitude and maps it via ``amplitude = "
"clamp(gain * (force - deadband), 0, saturation)`` (fields ``gain`` [1/N], "
"``deadband`` [N], ``saturation``, plus ``frequency_hz`` / ``duration_s`` for"
" the pulse)."
msgstr ""
"使用 :class:`~isaaclab_teleop.ControllerHapticFeedbackCfg` "
"。它将每只手的接触力汇总为一个振幅，通过 ``amplitude = clamp(gain * (force - deadband), 0, "
"saturation)`` 映射。字段包括 ``gain`` [1/N]、 ``deadband`` [N]、 ``saturation`` "
"，以及脉冲的 ``frequency_hz`` / ``duration_s`` 。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1647
msgid ""
"Enabled on the two G1 loco-manipulation teleop environments (``IsaacContrib-"
"PickPlace-Locomanipulation-G1-Abs``, ``IsaacContrib-PickPlace-"
"FixedBaseUpperBodyIK-G1-Abs``). Controller vibration is delivered over "
"OpenXR (``xrApplyHapticFeedback``), so no CloudXR ``.env`` profile change is"
" required."
msgstr ""
"两个 G1 遥操作环境（ ``IsaacContrib-PickPlace-Locomanipulation-G1-Abs`` 、 "
"``IsaacContrib-PickPlace-FixedBaseUpperBodyIK-G1-Abs`` ）已启用该功能。控制器振动通过 "
"OpenXR（ ``xrApplyHapticFeedback`` ）传输，无需修改 CloudXR ``.env`` 配置。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1653
msgid "Haptic glove (per-finger grip)"
msgstr "触觉手套（逐指抓握反馈）"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1655
msgid ""
"Use :class:`~isaaclab_teleop.GloveHapticFeedbackCfg`. Each hand's contact "
"sensor is **filtered against the grasped object** "
"(``filter_prim_paths_expr``), so ``normal_force_matrix_w`` reports each "
"finger's force on that object and nothing else. The driver orders the per-"
"finger magnitudes Thumb..Pinky (matched from the sensor's body names via "
"``finger_order``) into a ``FingerPowerVector`` rendered by a cross-process "
"glove device on ``collection_id``."
msgstr ""
"使用 :class:`~isaaclab_teleop.GloveHapticFeedbackCfg` 。每只手的接触传感器 "
"**只筛选与被抓取物体的接触** （ ``filter_prim_paths_expr`` ），因此 ``normal_force_matrix_w``"
" 仅报告各手指对该物体的力。驱动器按拇指到小指排序各指的力大小，通过 ``finger_order`` 匹配传感器刚体名称，组成 "
"``FingerPowerVector`` ，由 ``collection_id`` 上跨进程的手套设备输出。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1687
msgid ""
"Enabled on the two GR1T2 pick-place teleop environments (``IsaacContrib-"
"PickPlace-GR1T2-Abs``, ``IsaacContrib-PickPlace-GR1T2-WaistEnabled-Abs``)."
msgstr ""
"两个 GR1T2 抓取放置遥操作环境（ ``IsaacContrib-PickPlace-GR1T2-Abs`` 、 ``IsaacContrib-"
"PickPlace-GR1T2-WaistEnabled-Abs`` ）已启用该功能。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1692
msgid ""
"The glove is a *cross-process* device: ``GloveHapticFeedbackCfg`` pushes "
"per-finger powers on ``collection_id`` (default ``\"manus_glove_haptic\"``) "
"to a vendor plugin. Run that plugin and set ``NV_CXR_ENABLE_PUSH_DEVICES=1``"
" in a custom CloudXR profile (see :ref:`isaac-teleop-cloudxr-profiles`). "
"Contact-sensor ``prim_path`` regexes must match your robot's finger body "
"names -- verify with ``print(robot.data.body_names)`` if unsure."
msgstr ""
"手套是 *跨进程* 设备： ``GloveHapticFeedbackCfg`` 将逐指功率值通过 ``collection_id`` （默认 "
"``\"manus_glove_haptic\"`` ）推送给厂商插件。请运行该插件，并在自定义 CloudXR 配置中设置 "
"``NV_CXR_ENABLE_PUSH_DEVICES=1`` （见 :ref:`isaac-teleop-cloudxr-profiles` "
"）。接触传感器的 ``prim_path`` 正则表达式必须匹配机器人的手指刚体名称；不确定时，可通过 "
"``print(robot.data.body_names)`` 核对。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1702
msgid "Record Demonstrations for Imitation Learning"
msgstr "录制用于模仿学习的示范"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1704
msgid ""
"Isaac Capture integrates with Isaac Lab's ``record_demos.py`` script for "
"recording teleoperated demonstrations, exposed as the ``isaaclab teleop "
"record`` command."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Capture 与 Isaac Lab 的 ``record_demos.py`` 集成，用于录制遥操作示范，并提供 ``isaaclab "
"teleop record`` 命令。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1707
msgid ""
"When your environment configuration has an ``isaac_teleop`` attribute, the "
"script automatically uses ``create_isaac_teleop_device()`` -- no "
"``--teleop_device`` flag is needed:"
msgstr ""
"环境配置有 ``isaac_teleop`` 属性时，脚本会自动使用 ``create_isaac_teleop_device()`` ，无需 "
"``--teleop_device`` 标志："

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1730
msgid ""
"The ``run``, ``record``, and ``replay`` workflows accept task configuration "
"selectors using Hydra-style ``key=value`` syntax (with no leading ``--``). "
"For example, record the Franka reach task with the PhysX and differential IK"
" presets as follows:"
msgstr ""
"``run`` 、 ``record`` 和 ``replay`` 工作流接受 Hydra 风格的 ``key=value`` 任务配置选择项，前面不加"
" ``--`` 。例如，使用 PhysX 和微分 IK 预设录制 Franka Reach 任务："

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1744
msgid ""
"When replaying a preset-configured dataset, pass the same selectors again. "
"The HDF5 metadata stores the registered task ID, but not the command-line "
"selector values:"
msgstr "回放按预设配置的数据集时，需再次传入相同选择项。HDF5 元数据保存已注册的任务 ID，但不保存命令行选择项的值："

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1755
msgid ""
"Some environments use the legacy ``teleop_devices`` configuration instead of"
" ``isaac_teleop`` (e.g. the Galbot RmpFlow relative-mode tasks). For these, "
"pass ``--teleop_device`` to select the input device:"
msgstr ""
"部分环境仍使用原有的 ``teleop_devices`` 配置，而非 ``isaac_teleop`` ，如 Galbot RmpFlow "
"相对模式任务。这些环境需传入 ``--teleop_device`` 选择输入设备："

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1779
msgid "The workflow is:"
msgstr "工作流如下："

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1781
msgid ""
"Configure your environment with ``IsaacTeleopCfg`` (see :ref:`isaac-teleop-"
"env-config`) or ``teleop_devices`` for legacy devices (keyboard, "
"spacemouse)."
msgstr ""
"使用 ``IsaacTeleopCfg`` 配置环境（见 :ref:`isaac-teleop-env-config` "
"）；原有设备（键盘、SpaceMouse）则使用 ``teleop_devices`` 。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1783
msgid ""
"Run ``record_demos.py`` with the task name and any ``physics=``, "
"``renderer=``, or ``presets=`` selectors required by the task."
msgstr ""
"运行 ``record_demos.py`` ，指定任务名及任务所需的 ``physics=`` 、 ``renderer=`` 或 "
"``presets=`` 选择项。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1785
msgid ""
"For XR tasks: start AR, connect your XR device, and teleoperate. For legacy "
"tasks: use the configured input device directly."
msgstr "XR 任务：启动 AR，连接 XR 设备并遥操作。原有设备任务：直接使用所配置的输入设备。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1787
msgid "Demonstrations are recorded to HDF5 files."
msgstr "示范录制为 HDF5 文件。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1788
msgid ""
"Use the recorded data with Isaac Lab Mimic or other imitation learning "
"frameworks."
msgstr "将录制数据用于 Isaac Lab Mimic 或其他模仿学习框架。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1790
msgid ""
"For the broader imitation learning pipeline (replay, augmentation, policy "
"training), see :ref:`teleoperation-imitation-learning`."
msgstr ""
"更完整的模仿学习流水线，包括回放、数据扩充和策略训练，见 :ref:`teleoperation-imitation-learning` 。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1797
msgid "Add a New Robot"
msgstr "添加新机器人"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1799
msgid "To add teleoperation support for a new robot in Isaac Lab:"
msgstr "为 Isaac Lab 中的新机器人添加遥操作支持："

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1801
msgid ""
"**Choose a control scheme.** Refer to the :ref:`isaac-teleop-control-"
"schemes` table to determine which retargeters match your robot's "
"capabilities."
msgstr "**选择控制方案。** 参考 :ref:`isaac-teleop-control-schemes` 表，确定与机器人能力匹配的重定向器。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1804
msgid ""
"**Build the pipeline.** If existing retargeters are sufficient (e.g. "
"``Se3AbsRetargeter`` + ``GripperRetargeter`` for a new manipulator), write a"
" pipeline builder function following the pattern in :ref:`isaac-teleop-"
"pipeline-builder`. Configure the ``TensorReorderer`` output order to match "
"your environment's action space."
msgstr ""
"**构建流水线。** 如果已有重定向器足够使用，例如新机械臂采用 ``Se3AbsRetargeter`` + "
"``GripperRetargeter`` ，可按 :ref:`isaac-teleop-pipeline-builder` 编写流水线构建函数。设置 "
"``TensorReorderer`` 输出顺序，与环境动作空间一致。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1809
msgid ""
"**For dexterous hands**: create a robot hand URDF and YAML config for "
"``DexHandRetargeter``. Ensure fingertip links are positioned at the actual "
"fingertips, not mid-finger."
msgstr ""
"**对于灵巧手** ：为 ``DexHandRetargeter`` 创建机器人手的 URDF 和 YAML "
"配置，确保指尖连杆位于实际指尖，而非手指中部。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1812
msgid ""
"**For a custom retargeter**: see :ref:`isaac-teleop-new-retargeter` below."
msgstr "**对于自定义重定向器** ：见下文 :ref:`isaac-teleop-new-retargeter` 。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1814
msgid ""
"**Configure the XR anchor** for your robot (static for manipulation, dynamic"
" for locomotion). See :ref:`isaac-teleop-xr-anchor`."
msgstr ""
"为机器人 **配置 XR 锚点** ：操作任务使用静态锚点，运动任务使用动态锚点。见 :ref:`isaac-teleop-xr-anchor` 。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1817
msgid ""
"**Register in env config** via ``IsaacTeleopCfg`` (see :ref:`isaac-teleop-"
"env-config`)."
msgstr ""
"通过 ``IsaacTeleopCfg`` **在环境配置中注册** （见 :ref:`isaac-teleop-env-config` ）。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1823
msgid "Add a New Retargeter"
msgstr "添加新重定向器"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1825
msgid ""
"If the built-in retargeters do not cover your use case, you can implement a "
"custom one in the `Isaac Capture repository "
"<https://github.com/NVIDIA/IsaacCapture>`_:"
msgstr ""
"如果内置重定向器不能满足需求，可在 `Isaac Capture 仓库 "
"<https://github.com/NVIDIA/IsaacCapture>`_ 中实现自定义重定向器："

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1828
msgid ""
"Inherit from ``BaseRetargeter`` and implement ``input_spec()``, "
"``output_spec()``, and ``compute()``."
msgstr ""
"继承 ``BaseRetargeter`` ，实现 ``input_spec()`` 、 ``output_spec()`` 和 "
"``compute()`` 。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1830
msgid ""
"Optionally add a ``ParameterState`` for parameters that should be live-"
"tunable via the retargeter tuning UI."
msgstr "可选添加 ``ParameterState`` ，为需要在重定向调参界面中实时调整的参数提供状态。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1832
msgid ""
"Connect to existing source nodes (``HandsSource``, ``ControllersSource``) or"
" create a new ``IDeviceIOSource`` subclass for custom input devices."
msgstr ""
"连接现有源节点（ ``HandsSource`` 、 ``ControllersSource`` ），或为自定义输入设备创建新的 "
"``IDeviceIOSource`` 子类。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1835
msgid ""
"See the `Isaac Capture repository <https://github.com/NVIDIA/IsaacCapture>`_"
" and `Contributing Guide "
"<https://github.com/NVIDIA/IsaacCapture/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md>`_ for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"详见 `Isaac Capture 仓库 <https://github.com/NVIDIA/IsaacCapture>`_ 及 `贡献指南 "
"<https://github.com/NVIDIA/IsaacCapture/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md>`_ 。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1842
msgid "Add a New Device"
msgstr "添加新设备"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1844
msgid "There are two levels of device integration:"
msgstr "设备集成有两个层级："

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1846
msgid "**Isaac Capture plugin (C++ level)**"
msgstr "**Isaac Capture 插件（C++ 层）**"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1847
msgid ""
"For new hardware that requires a custom driver or SDK. Plugins push data via"
" OpenXR tensor collections. Existing plugins include Manus gloves, Haptikos "
"exoskeletons, OAK-D camera, controller synthetic hands, and foot pedals. "
"After creating the plugin, update the retargeting pipeline config to consume"
" data from the new plugin's source node."
msgstr ""
"适用于需要自定义驱动或 SDK 的新硬件。插件通过 OpenXR 张量集合推送数据。现有插件包括 Manus 手套、Haptikos 外骨骼、OAK-D"
" 相机、控制器合成手部和脚踏板。创建插件后，更新重定向流水线配置，读取新插件源节点的数据。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1852
msgid ""
"See the `Plugins directory "
"<https://github.com/NVIDIA/IsaacCapture/tree/main/src/plugins/>`_ for "
"examples."
msgstr ""
"示例见 `插件目录 <https://github.com/NVIDIA/IsaacCapture/tree/main/src/plugins/>`_ "
"。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1854
msgid "**Pipeline configuration only**"
msgstr "**仅配置流水线**"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1855
msgid ""
"For devices already supported by Isaac Capture (or whose data is available "
"as hand / controller tracking). Simply update your ``pipeline_builder`` to "
"use the appropriate source nodes and retargeters for the device's data "
"format."
msgstr ""
"适用于 Isaac Capture 已支持的设备，或其数据能以手部/控制器跟踪形式提供的设备。只需更新 ``pipeline_builder`` "
"，选用与设备数据格式匹配的源节点和重定向器。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1863
msgid "Optimize XR Performance"
msgstr "优化 XR 性能"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:0
msgid "Configure the physics and render time step"
msgstr "配置物理和渲染时间步"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1868
msgid ""
"Ensure the simulation render time step roughly matches the XR device's "
"display rate and can be sustained in real time. Quest 3 and Pico 4 Ultra "
"typically run at 90 Hz, so we recommend a simulation ``dt`` of 90 Hz with a "
"``render_interval`` of 2 (rendering at 45 Hz):"
msgstr ""
"确保仿真渲染步长大致匹配 XR 设备的显示频率，且能够持续实时运行。Quest 3 和 Pico 4 Ultra 通常为 90 Hz，因此建议将仿真 "
"``dt`` 设为对应 90 Hz 的步长， ``render_interval`` 设为 2，即以 45 Hz 渲染："

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1881
msgid ""
"``sim.render_interval`` is the number of physics simulation steps that occur"
" between renders. Increasing it reduces rendering frequency (and GPU cost) "
"without changing physics behavior -- useful when physics can keep up but "
"rendering cannot."
msgstr ""
"``sim.render_interval`` 表示两次渲染之间的物理仿真步数。增大该值可降低渲染频率及 GPU "
"开销，不改变物理行为，适合物理计算能跟上、渲染却跟不上的情况。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1885
msgid ""
"The choice of ``sim.dt`` is a trade-off between stability and performance: a"
" smaller ``dt`` (e.g. ``1.0 / 120``) integrates contacts more accurately and"
" is more stable for stiff contact-rich tasks, but each step costs more wall-"
"clock time and lowers achievable frame rate. A larger ``dt`` (e.g. ``1.0 / "
"60``) is cheaper but can introduce contact jitter or instabilities. Pick the"
" largest ``dt`` your task tolerates."
msgstr ""
"``sim.dt`` 需要在稳定性与性能之间取舍。较小的 ``dt`` （如 ``1.0 / 120`` "
"）能更精确地积分接触，对刚性强、接触多的任务更稳定，但每步实际耗时更高，降低可达帧率。较大的 ``dt`` （如 ``1.0 / 60`` "
"）开销较低，但可能产生接触抖动或不稳定。请选择任务能够容忍的最大 ``dt`` 。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:0
msgid "Switch the viewport to the RTX - Minimal renderer"
msgstr "将视口切换到 RTX - Minimal 渲染器"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1894
msgid ""
"The RTX - Minimal renderer trades image fidelity for substantially lower "
"per-frame GPU cost. It is the recommended choice when the simulation cannot "
"sustain the XR device's display rate in real time -- for example on lower-"
"spec GPUs, in scenes with many lights or complex materials, or when you have"
" already configured ``sim.dt`` and ``sim.render_interval`` and still see "
"dropped frames."
msgstr ""
"RTX - Minimal 以降低图像保真度换取显著减少的每帧 GPU 开销。如果仿真无法实时达到 XR 设备显示频率，例如 GPU "
"性能较低、场景包含大量灯光或复杂材质，或调整 ``sim.dt`` 和 ``sim.render_interval`` 后仍掉帧，建议采用此渲染器。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1900
msgid "Known issue"
msgstr "已知问题"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1903
msgid ""
"Starting an XR session while RTX - Minimal is already the active renderer is"
" a known issue: robot control inputs may never be applied and teleoperation "
"stays non-functional, with no error reported. Switching to RTX - Minimal "
"*after* the XR session has started and teleoperation is confirmed working is"
" not affected."
msgstr ""
"在 RTX - Minimal 已是当前渲染器时启动 XR 会话，存在已知问题：机器人控制输入可能始终不被应用，遥操作无法工作，也没有错误提示。XR "
"会话启动且确认遥操作正常 *之后* 再切换到 RTX - Minimal，不受影响。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1908
msgid ""
"As a workaround, start under the default renderer before switching to RTX - "
"Minimal:"
msgstr "临时解决办法是先使用默认渲染器启动，再切换到 RTX - Minimal："

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1910
msgid "Launch Isaac Lab with the default renderer and start the XR session."
msgstr "使用默认渲染器启动 Isaac Lab，并开启 XR 会话。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1911
msgid ""
"Confirm that teleoperation is working (the robot responds to your hand "
"motions)."
msgstr "确认遥操作正常，机器人能响应手部动作。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1912
msgid "Switch the viewport renderer to **RTX - Minimal** as described below."
msgstr "按下文说明，将视口渲染器切换为 **RTX - Minimal** 。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1914
msgid ""
"To enable it, click the renderer dropdown at the top-left of the Isaac Lab "
"viewport and select **RTX - Minimal**:"
msgstr "点击 Isaac Lab 视口左上角的渲染器下拉菜单，选择 **RTX - Minimal** ："

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1917
msgid "Viewport renderer dropdown with RTX - Minimal selected"
msgstr "视口渲染器下拉菜单中选中 RTX - Minimal"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1921
msgid "Selecting the **RTX - Minimal** renderer from the viewport dropdown."
msgstr "从视口下拉菜单选择 **RTX - Minimal** 渲染器。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1923
msgid ""
"For best results, open **Render Settings** from the top-right of the Isaac "
"Lab UI, switch to the **Minimal** tab, and set **Minimal Shading Mode** to "
"**Diffuse/Glossy/Emission**:"
msgstr ""
"为获得更好的效果，点击 Isaac Lab 界面右上角的 **Render Settings** ，切换到 **Minimal** 选项卡，将 "
"**Minimal Shading Mode** 设为 **Diffuse/Glossy/Emission** ："

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1926
msgid "Render Settings panel showing the Minimal Shading Mode options"
msgstr "Render Settings 面板中的 Minimal Shading Mode 选项"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1930
msgid ""
"The **Render Settings** panel with the **Minimal Shading Mode** dropdown "
"open (recommended: **Diffuse/Glossy/Emission**)."
msgstr ""
"**Render Settings** 面板中展开的 **Minimal Shading Mode** 下拉菜单，推荐选择 "
"**Diffuse/Glossy/Emission** 。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1935
msgid ""
"The RTX Minimal renderer currently only supports ``DistantLight`` prims for "
"scene illumination -- ``DomeLight`` prims are ignored. If your environment "
"uses a ``DomeLight``, swap (or supplement) it with a ``DistantLight`` so the"
" scene is lit when running under RTX Minimal:"
msgstr ""
"RTX Minimal 目前仅支持 ``DistantLight`` prim 照明，会忽略 ``DomeLight`` 。如果环境使用 "
"``DomeLight`` ，请将其替换为 ``DistantLight`` ，或额外添加 ``DistantLight`` ，确保 RTX "
"Minimal 下场景有光照："

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1950
msgid ""
"Depending on your environment, the default ``DistantLight`` orientation may "
"cast shadows that overlap the robot and reduce visibility during "
"teleoperation. If you encounter this, adjust the light's orientation via "
"``init_state`` on :class:`~isaaclab.assets.AssetBaseCfg` to position the "
"light source at an angle that gives clear visibility:"
msgstr ""
"在某些环境中， ``DistantLight`` 的默认朝向可能让阴影覆盖机器人，影响遥操作时的可见性。此时，可通过 "
":class:`~isaaclab.assets.AssetBaseCfg` 的 ``init_state`` 调整光源朝向，使照明角度更合适："

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1968
msgid ""
"Experiment with different orientations in your scene to find an angle that "
"avoids shadow overlap on the robot. A slight tilt away from the camera "
"viewpoint is a good starting point."
msgstr "尝试不同朝向，找到不会让阴影遮住机器人的角度。可先从相机视角稍向外倾斜开始调整。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:0
msgid "Lower the XR render resolution"
msgstr "降低 XR 渲染分辨率"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1975
msgid ""
"The XR render resolution multiplier scales the size of the render buffers "
"that are then upscaled to the headset's recommended display resolution. "
"Lowering it trades image sharpness for substantially lower per-frame GPU "
"cost, which can help sustain real-time frame rates on lower-spec GPUs or in "
"heavy scenes."
msgstr ""
"XR 渲染分辨率倍数缩放渲染缓冲区尺寸，再将画面放大到头显推荐显示分辨率。降低该值会牺牲清晰度，但显著减少每帧 GPU 开销，有助于性能较低的 GPU "
"或复杂场景维持实时帧率。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1980
msgid ""
"In the Isaac Lab UI, open the **XR** tab on the right-side panel, expand "
"**Advanced Settings -> Render Resolution**, and drag the **Resolution "
"Multiplier** slider:"
msgstr ""
"在 Isaac Lab 界面右侧打开 **XR** 选项卡，展开 **Advanced Settings -> Render Resolution** "
"，拖动 **Resolution Multiplier** 滑块："

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1983
msgid "XR Render Resolution slider in the Advanced Settings panel"
msgstr "Advanced Settings 面板中的 XR 渲染分辨率滑块"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1987
msgid ""
"The **Resolution Multiplier** under **XR -> Advanced Settings -> Render "
"Resolution**. Values below ``1.0`` reduce the render-buffer size before "
"upscaling to the headset."
msgstr ""
"**XR -> Advanced Settings -> Render Resolution** 下的 **Resolution "
"Multiplier** 。小于 ``1.0`` 时，先减小渲染缓冲区，再放大到头显分辨率。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1990
msgid ""
"A value around ``0.8`` is usually a good starting point: noticeable GPU "
"savings with minimal perceptible quality loss. Reduce further only if you "
"still cannot hit the headset's display rate."
msgstr "通常可先尝试 ``0.8`` ，能明显节省 GPU 开销，而可感知的画质损失较小。只有仍无法达到头显显示频率时，才进一步降低。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:0
msgid "Disable external camera rendering"
msgstr "关闭外部相机渲染"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:1997
msgid ""
"The teleop scripts (``teleop_se3_agent.py``, ``record_demos.py``, and "
"``teleop_replay_agent.py``) render external camera sensors by default. "
"Camera render products add significant GPU cost and contend with the XR "
"view, so if your task does not need camera observations during "
"teleoperation, disable them with ``--disable_external_cameras``:"
msgstr ""
"遥操作脚本（ ``teleop_se3_agent.py`` 、 ``record_demos.py`` 、 "
"``teleop_replay_agent.py`` ）默认渲染外部相机传感器。相机渲染产物会带来显著 GPU 开销，并与 XR "
"视图争用资源。如果遥操作时不需要相机观测，可通过 ``--disable_external_cameras`` 关闭："

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:2009
msgid ""
"The flag strips the environment's camera sensors (equivalent to calling "
":func:`~isaaclab_teleop.remove_camera_configs` on the env config) and "
"selects a lighter Kit experience. For ``teleop_se3_agent.py`` it is also the"
" master PiP gate: task-default and task-configured feeds are ignored and no "
"camera panel is created. Omit it to keep cameras enabled (the default) -- "
"required when recording camera observations, showing XR camera feedback, or "
"when you want ``teleop_replay_agent.py`` to mirror the production render "
"load."
msgstr ""
"该标志移除环境中的相机传感器（等同于对环境配置调用 :func:`~isaaclab_teleop.remove_camera_configs` "
"），并选择更轻量的 Kit experience。对 ``teleop_se3_agent.py`` "
"，它也是画中画总开关：任务默认及用户配置的画面均被忽略，不创建相机面板。省略它则保持相机启用（默认）；录制相机观测、显示 XR 相机反馈，或希望 "
"``teleop_replay_agent.py`` 复现实际运行中的渲染负载时，必须保留相机。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:0
msgid "Run headless (skip the local viewport)"
msgstr "无界面运行（跳过本地视口）"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:2019
msgid ""
"Passing ``--visualizer kit`` opens the local Kit viewport, which renders a "
"window on the host in addition to the XR view. On a server or cloud instance"
" -- or whenever you do not need the local window -- run headless so only the"
" XR view is rendered, freeing GPU for the headset:"
msgstr ""
"传入 ``--visualizer kit`` 会打开本地 Kit 视口，除了 XR "
"视图外，还在主机上渲染窗口。在服务器、云实例上，或不需要本地窗口时，可无界面运行，只渲染 XR 视图，为头显腾出 GPU 资源："

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:2029
msgid ""
"In headless XR the OpenXR/AR session **starts automatically** -- there is no"
" local viewport to click **Start XR**, so Isaac Lab begins streaming as soon"
" as a CloudXR client connects."
msgstr ""
"无界面 XR 模式下，OpenXR/AR 会话 **自动启动** 。没有本地视口可点击 **Start XR** ，因此 CloudXR "
"客户端一连接，Isaac Lab 就开始串流。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:2034
msgid ""
"The ``--headless`` CLI flag was removed in Isaac Lab 3.0. Headless is now "
"the **default** (omit ``--visualizer``); pass ``--visualizer none`` / "
"``--viz none`` to force it when a config might otherwise enable a "
"visualizer, or set ``HEADLESS=1`` in the environment."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 3.0 已移除 ``--headless`` 命令行标志。无界面模式现在是 **默认行为** ，省略 "
"``--visualizer`` 即可。如果配置可能启用可视化器，可传入 ``--visualizer none`` / ``--viz none`` "
"强制关闭，或设置环境变量 ``HEADLESS=1`` 。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:0
msgid "Configure retargeting execution"
msgstr "配置重定向执行方式"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:2041
msgid ""
"Isaac Capture can run retargeting either synchronously on the application "
"thread or asynchronously through a pipelined worker. This is controlled by "
"``RetargetingExecutionConfig``."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Capture 可在应用线程上同步执行重定向，也可通过流水线工作线程异步执行，由 "
"``RetargetingExecutionConfig`` 控制。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:2045
msgid ""
"In synchronous mode, retargeting runs inline with the simulation step. This "
"can be the best choice for lightweight retargeting or retargeting "
"implemented mostly in Python, since a background Python worker can still "
"contend with the application thread through the GIL."
msgstr ""
"同步模式下，重定向直接在仿真步内执行。对于轻量或主要用 Python 实现的重定向，这可能是最佳选择，因为后台 Python 工作线程仍可能通过 GIL"
" 与应用线程争用。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:2050
msgid ""
"In pipelined mode, Isaac Capture submits retargeting work to a background "
"worker and the application uses the most recent completed result. This is "
"useful when retargeting has enough native work to overlap with simulation or"
" rendering, or when the retargeting cost is large enough that running it "
"inline would directly extend the frame."
msgstr ""
"流水线模式下，Isaac Capture "
"将重定向提交给后台工作线程，应用使用最近完成的结果。如果重定向包含足够多的原生操作，可与仿真或渲染重叠，或重定向开销较大、同步执行会直接延长帧耗时，适合使用这种模式。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:2062
msgid ""
"``DeadlinePacingConfig`` intentionally delays the background retargeting "
"work until closer to when the next result is needed, instead of starting it "
"immediately when the request is submitted. This helps avoid competing with "
"the Python work Isaac Lab performs at the beginning of the frame, and tends "
"to line the retargeting work up with rendering or other native work where "
"overlap is more useful."
msgstr ""
"``DeadlinePacingConfig`` 有意将后台重定向推迟到更接近下一次需要结果的时刻，而非提交请求后立即执行。这样可避免与 Isaac "
"Lab 在帧开始时的 Python 工作争用，并倾向于让重定向与渲染或其他原生操作同时进行，获得更有效的重叠执行。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:2068
msgid ""
"The ``safety_margin_s`` value controls how early retargeting starts before "
"the predicted deadline. A larger margin starts retargeting earlier, which "
"gives heavier or more variable retargeting work more time to finish before "
"the next frame consumes the result. The trade-off is that the input sample "
"may be slightly older, and Python-heavy retargeting may introduce more GIL "
"contention."
msgstr ""
"``safety_margin_s`` "
"控制在预计截止时间前多久启动重定向。余量越大，启动越早，为开销较大或波动较大的重定向留出更多时间，确保下一帧使用结果前完成。代价是输入样本可能略旧，且主要使用"
" Python 的重定向可能带来更多 GIL 争用。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:2074
msgid ""
"If retargeting is mostly Python and lightweight, consider ``mode=\"sync\"``."
" If retargeting performs substantial native work or has occasional long "
"spikes, use ``mode=\"pipelined\"`` and increase ``safety_margin_s`` so the "
"work starts earlier."
msgstr ""
"主要使用 Python 且开销较小的重定向，可考虑 ``mode=\"sync\"`` 。包含大量原生操作或偶尔耗时突增时，使用 "
"``mode=\"pipelined\"`` ，并增大 ``safety_margin_s`` ，让工作更早开始。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:0
msgid "Check CloudXR frame pacing"
msgstr "检查 CloudXR 帧节奏"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:2081
msgid ""
"The CloudXR Runtime frame pacer attempts to keep the client experience "
"smooth. If the application has repeated frame-time spikes, the pacer may "
"settle at a lower stable frame rate instead of oscillating between rates. "
"This can make a connected client appear slower even when Isaac Lab profiling"
" does not show a proportional simulation-side regression."
msgstr ""
"CloudXR Runtime 的帧节奏控制器旨在保持客户端体验平滑。如果应用反复出现帧耗时突增，它可能稳定在较低帧率，而非在不同帧率间振荡。因此，即使"
" Isaac Lab 性能分析未显示仿真侧有相应幅度的性能下降，已连接客户端仍可能看起来变慢。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:2086
msgid ""
"The shipped CloudXR profiles set ``NV_ENABLE_POSE_WAIT=0`` to mitigate this "
"case, favoring lower latency over pose-wait smoothing. If you use a custom "
"``.env`` file, copy that setting into the custom profile, then point "
"``teleop_se3_agent.py`` or ``record_demos.py`` at it with ``--cloudxr_env``."
" See :ref:`isaac-teleop-cloudxr-profiles` for the profile override workflow."
msgstr ""
"附带的 CloudXR 配置通过 ``NV_ENABLE_POSE_WAIT=0`` 缓解这种情况，优先降低延迟，而非采用位姿等待平滑。使用自定义 "
"``.env`` 时，请复制此设置，再通过 ``--cloudxr_env`` 让 ``teleop_se3_agent.py`` 或 "
"``record_demos.py`` 使用它。配置覆盖方法见 :ref:`isaac-teleop-cloudxr-profiles` 。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:2095
msgid "Known Issues"
msgstr "已知问题"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:2097
msgid "OpenXR runtime error messages (``XR_ERROR_...``) are hidden by default"
msgstr "默认隐藏 OpenXR 运行时错误（ ``XR_ERROR_...`` ）"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:2099
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab sets ``OXR_NO_PRINTING=true`` for teleoperation sessions. Set "
"``OXR_NO_PRINTING=false`` before launching to see them when debugging an XR "
"connection."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 为遥操作会话设置 ``OXR_NO_PRINTING=true`` 。调试 XR 连接时，可在启动前设置 "
"``OXR_NO_PRINTING=false`` 查看这些错误。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:2102
msgid ""
"``XR_ERROR_VALIDATION_FAILURE: xrWaitFrame(frameState->type == 0)`` when "
"stopping AR Mode"
msgstr ""
"停止 AR 模式时报错 ``XR_ERROR_VALIDATION_FAILURE: xrWaitFrame(frameState->type == "
"0)``"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:2104
msgid "Can be safely ignored. Caused by a race condition in the exit handler."
msgstr "可以安全忽略，由退出处理器中的竞态条件引起。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:2106
msgid "``XR_ERROR_INSTANCE_LOST in xrPollEvent``"
msgstr "``XR_ERROR_INSTANCE_LOST in xrPollEvent``"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:2108
msgid ""
"Occurs if the CloudXR runtime exits before Isaac Lab. Restart the runtime to"
" resume."
msgstr "CloudXR 运行时先于 Isaac Lab 退出时出现，重启运行时即可恢复。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:2110
msgid "``[omni.usd] TF_PYTHON_EXCEPTION`` when starting/stopping AR Mode"
msgstr "启动或停止 AR 模式时报错 ``[omni.usd] TF_PYTHON_EXCEPTION``"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:2112
msgid ""
"Can be safely ignored. Caused by a race condition in the enter/exit handler."
msgstr "可以安全忽略，由进入/退出处理器中的竞态条件引起。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:2114
msgid "``Invalid version string in _ParseVersionString``"
msgstr "``Invalid version string in _ParseVersionString``"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:2116
msgid ""
"Caused by shader assets authored with older USD versions. Typically safe to "
"ignore."
msgstr "由采用旧版 USD 编写的着色器资产引起，通常可以安全忽略。"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:2118
msgid ""
"XR device connects but no video is displayed (viewport responds to tracking)"
msgstr "XR 设备已连接但没有视频画面（视口响应跟踪）"

#: source/features/isaac_teleop.rst:2120
msgid ""
"The GPU index may differ between host and container. Set ``NV_GPU_INDEX`` to"
" ``0``, ``1``, or ``2`` in the runtime to match the host GPU."
msgstr ""
"主机与容器中的 GPU 索引可能不同。请在运行时将 ``NV_GPU_INDEX`` 设为与主机 GPU 对应的 ``0`` 、 ``1`` 或 "
"``2`` 。"

